('stir', '/stɜːr/', 'v.激发（兴趣）；搅拌，搅动；动，移动；轰动；搅和；挪动，活动，离开 ；激动；  n.感动，激动，愤怒，震动；搅拌，搅动；骚乱', 'to excite the feelings of; move strongly', 'The TV adverts stir up the children''s interest.', '电视广告激起了孩子们的兴趣。', '', 'st[ir]'),
('rating', '/ˈreɪtɪŋ/', 'n.评价', 'a measurement of how good', 'We received an excellent rating for our customer service.', '我们的客户服务得到了超赞的评价。', 'rat=calculate计算 + ing名词后缀，构成抽象名词 → rating等级', 'rat-[ing]'),
('complement', '/ˈkɑːmpləment/', 'v.补充', 'to add to something in a way that improves it or makes it more attractive', 'Sometimes work and life can complement each other.', '工作与生活有时可以互补。', 'com全部 + ple满，填满 + ment名词后缀 → 全部填满 → complement补充', 'com-[ple]-ment'),
('noticeable', '/ˈnoʊtɪsəbl/', 'adj.明显的，显著的；引人注目的', 'easy to see or notice; clear or definite', 'It was noticeable that the rabbit''s friend was in the snake''s stomach.', '显而易见的是，小兔子的朋友在蛇的肚子里。', 'notice注意，表示行为 + able可...的 → noticeable引人注目的', 'no-tice-a[ble]'),
('feeble', '/ˈfiːbl/', 'adj.虚弱的', 'very weak; not effective; not showing determination or energy', 'The feeble old man found it difficult to climb the stairs.', '这位虚弱的老人连爬楼梯都很困难。', '', 'fee-[ble]'),
('fracture', '/ˈfræktʃər/', 'n.折断', 'to break or crack; to make something break or crack', 'The tree had a fracture on the branch.', '这棵树的树枝被折断了。', 'fract打碎 + ure名词后缀 → 断的状态 → fracture骨折', 'frac-t[ure]'),
('alleviate', '/əˈliːvieɪt/', 'v.减轻；缓解', 'to make something less severe', 'This kind of medicine could alleviate my toothache.', '这种药可以减轻我的牙疼。', 'al=ad加强 + levi提高，变轻 + ate 表示做，造成 → 减轻，缓解，缓和', '[all]e-vi-ate');
INSERT INTO `cet6_word` (`word`, `phonetic`, `translate`, `definition_en`, `example_en`, `example_cn`, `mnemonic`, `cloze`) VALUES
('vow', '/vaʊ/', 'v.立誓，宣誓，发誓', 'a formal and serious promise', 'The husband and wife each vow to love the other forever.', '新郎和新娘都发誓会永远爱对方。', '', 'v[ow]'),
('carpenter', '/ˈkɑːrpəntər/', 'n.木匠，木工', 'a person whose job is making and repairing wooden objects and structures', 'The carpenter is making wooden furniture.', '这个木匠正在做木制家具。', '', 'c[ar]-pen-ter'),
('illuminate', '/ɪˈluːmɪneɪt/', 'v.照亮；阐释', 'to shine light on something', 'The torch illuminated his face in the dark.', '黑暗中，火把照亮了他的脸。', 'il使…成为，进入 + lumin光 + ate动词后缀 → 进入光明 → illuminate使明白；照亮', 'illu-m[i]-nate'),
('access', '/''ækses/', 'n.（使用或见到的）机会，权利；通道，入口；  v.进入，使用，获取', 'a way of entering or reaching a place', 'Your thumbprint will give you access to that room.', '你拇指的指纹可以让你进入那个密室。', 'ac一再 + cess=go行走 → 接近；入口', 'acce[ss]'),
('conceive', '/kənˈsiːv/', 'v.设想，想出', 'when a woman conceives a child', 'The little girl conceived herself as a dancer.', '小女孩设想自己是一名舞者。', 'con共同 + ceive拿，抓，握住 → conceive想象；构想', 'con-c[ei]ve'),
('composite', '/kəmˈpɑːzɪt/', 'adj.合成的，复合的；  n.合成物，复合材料', 'made of different parts or materials', 'She made a composite photo of herself at the beach.', '她合成了一张自己在海滩的照片。', 'com一起 + pos放 + ite…的 → 放到一起的 → 合成的', 'com-p[o]s-ite'),
('comprehensive', '/ˌkɑːmprɪˈhensɪv/', 'adj.全面的，完整的；详尽的', 'includes everything that is needed or relevant; including all', 'She''s making a comprehensive consideration of all her options.', '她正在全面考虑她所有的选择。', 'comprehens理解 + ive形容词后缀 → comprehensive有理解力的；综合的', 'com-pr[e]-h[en]-sive'),
('request', '/rɪˈkwest/', 'n.（正式或礼貌的）请求', 'an act of politely or formally asking for something', 'She made a request to the waiter for a vegan menu.', '她向服务员请求，来一份素食菜单。', 're再 + quest寻求，询问 → 再寻求 → request要求', 're-[que]st'),
('maintenance', '/ˈmeɪntənəns/', 'n.维护；维修', 'the act of keeping something in good condition by checking or repairing it regularly', 'My car wasn''t working so it needed maintenance.', '我的车用不了了，需要修理。', 'main手 + ten拿住 + ance表名词 → 用手拿住 → maintenance维持', 'm[ai]n-te-nance'),
('competitive', '/kəmˈpetətɪv/', 'adj.努力竞争的；有竞争力的', 'used to describe a situation in which people or organizations compete against each other', 'The soccer game was really competitive.', '这场足球赛真的很有竞争性。', 'compet=compete竞争 + itive..的 → competitive有竞争力的；竞争的', 'com-p[e]-t[i]-tive'),
('ethnic', '/ˈeθnɪk/', 'adj.民族的', 'connected with or belonging to a nation', 'The three people come from different ethnic groups.', '这三个人来自不同的少数民族。', 'ethn民族 + ic……的 → ethnic种族的', 'e[th]-nic'),
('prayer', '/prer/', 'n.祈祷，祷告', 'words that you say to God giving thanks or asking for help', 'Christians usually say a prayer before eating a shared meal.', '基督教徒有饭前祷告的习俗。', 'pray祈祷 + er表物 → prayer祷文，祷辞', 'pray[er]'),
('Spanish', '/ˈspænɪʃ/', 'adj.西班牙的；  n.西班牙语', 'the Romance language spoken in most of Spain and the countries colonized by Spain', '"Bullfighting', '斗牛、海鲜饭和弗拉门科舞这些都与西班牙文化息息相关。', 'span西班牙 + ish某国的 → Spanish 西班牙的', ''),
('portfolio', '/pɔːrtˈfoʊlioʊ/', 'n.公文包，文件夹', 'a thin flat case used for carrying documents', 'He is checking his portfolio to find some documents.', '他正在找公文包里的文件。', 'port拿，运 + folio树叶，页 → 拿树叶[书页]的东西 → 文件夹；投资组合', 'p[or]t-fo-lio'),
('sparkle', '/ˈspɑːrkl/', 'v.闪耀', 'to shine brightly with small flashes of light', 'The stars are beautiful as they sparkle in the sky.', '星星在天空中闪耀时，看上去很美。', 'spark星火 + le动词后缀 → sparkle发火花', 'spar[kle]'),
('destroy', '/dɪˈstrɔɪ/', 'v.摧毁；破坏', 'to damage something so badly that it no longer exists', 'My dog destroyed my sofa.', '我的狗毁掉了我的沙发。', 'de向下，表否定 + stroy建立 → destroy毁灭', 'de-str[oy]'),
('outstanding', '/aʊtˈstændɪŋ/', 'adj.杰出的，出众的', 'very remarkable and impressive', 'Their outstanding skill led them to victory in the soccer competition.', '凭借出色的球技，她们赢得了球赛。', 'outstand突出 + ing形容词后缀 → outstanding突出的，杰出的', '[ou]t-stand-ing'),
('disk', '/dɪsk/', 'n.圆盘，唱片(=disc)', 'a thin round piece of plastic on which music', 'Music was recorded on this compact disk(CD).', '音乐被刻录在这张光盘上。', '', 'd[i]sk'),
('edition', '/ɪˈdɪʃn/', 'n.版，版本，版次', 'the form in which a book is published; the total number of copies of a book', '"The dictionary is now in its third edition', '这本字典现在是第三版，于2017年出版。', 'edit编辑 + ion名词后缀 → 编成的样本 → edition版，版本', 'edi-t[io]n'),
('illegal', '/ɪˈliːɡl/', 'adj.非法的', 'not allowed by the law', 'Occupying a bus lane is illegal.', '占用公交车道是违法的。', 'il不，无 + legal合法的 → illegal非法的', 'ille-g[al]'),
('explore', '/ɪkˈsplɔːr/', 'v.探索；探讨，研究', 'to examine something completely or carefully in order to find out more about it', 'I''d love to be the first to explore another planet.', '我想成为探索其他星球的第一人。', 'ex出，向外 + plore哭泣，叫喊 → explore探险', 'ex-pl[or]e'),
('workshop', '/ˈwɜːrkʃɑːp/', 'n.研讨会，工作坊', 'a room or building in which things are made or repaired using tools or machinery; a period of discussion and practical work on a particular subject', 'The teachers are having a teaching workshop.', '老师们在开教学研讨会。', 'work工作 + shop工厂 → workshop车间', 'work-[sh]op'),
('wool', '/wʊl/', 'n.（羊等动物的）毛', 'the soft fine hair that covers the body of sheep', 'Lend me your wool please. I''ll make a pretty sweater for you.', '借我点儿你的羊毛，我要给你织一件漂亮的毛衣。', '', 'wo[ol]'),
('dialog', '/ˈdaɪəlɔːɡ/', 'n.对话（=dialogue）', 'conversations in a book', 'The two sides entered into a peace dialog.', '双方进行了一次和平对话。', 'dia穿过，之间 + log说话 → dialog对话', ''),
('socialism', '/ˈsoʊʃəlɪzəm/', 'n.社会主义', 'a set of political and economic theories based on the belief that everyone has an equal right to a share of a country’s wealth and that the government should own and control the main industries', '"The hammer and sickle represents socialism. Workers', '锤头和镰刀代表了社会主义。工人们，团结起来！', 'soc社会 + ial...的 + ism主义 → socialism社会主义', 'so-c[ial]-ism'),
('panic', '/ˈpænɪk/', 'n.恐慌，惊恐', 'a sudden feeling of great fear that cannot be controlled and prevents you from thinking clearly', 'The student got into a panic when the teacher caught him on his phone.', '当他被老师抓到玩手机时，这个学生惊慌失措。', '', 'pan-[i]c'),
('elegant', '/ˈelɪɡənt/', 'adj.优雅的，典雅的', '(of people or their behaviour) attractive and showing a good sense of style; (of clothes', 'The ballet dancer is incredibly elegant.', '这位芭蕾舞演员非常优雅。', 'e出 + leg选择，收集 + ant形容词后缀 → 选出的 → elegant好的，高雅的', 'e-[le]-gant'),
('outfit', '/ˈaʊtfɪt/', 'n.装备，装束，全套服装', 'a set of clothes that you wear together', 'The singer''s fancy outfit added to his stage presence.', '华丽服饰令歌手的舞台形象更加出众。', 'out外 + fit装备 → outfit全套装备，套装', '[ou]t-fit'),
('glow', '/ɡləʊ/', 'v.发光，发出微光', 'a gold or red colour; a dull steady light', 'The burning coals glow in the dark.', '燃烧的煤炭在黑暗中发出光亮。', '', 'gl[ow]'),
('feminine', '/ˈfemənɪn/', 'adj.女性的', 'having the qualities or appearance considered to be typical of women; connected with women', 'Flowers have feminine connotations in most cultures.', '在许多文化中，花蕴含了女性意义。', 'femin女 + ine…的 → feminine女性的，妇女的', 'fe-mi-n[in]e'),
('observatory', '/əbˈzɜːrvətɔːri/', 'n.天文台，气象台，瞭望台', 'a special building for studying stars', 'The observatory was built to observe stars at night.', '那个天文台是为了观察夜空中的星体而建造的。', 'observ观察 ＋ atory场所 → observatory天文台', 'ob-s[er]-v[a]-to-ry'),
('stall', '/stɔːl/', 'n.售货摊，摊位；  v.（使发动机）熄火', 'a table or small shop with an open front that people sell things from', 'There are many stalls in the open-air market.', '露天集市上有许多货摊。', '', 'st[all]'),
('verb', '/vɜːrb/', 'n.动词', 'a word or group of words that expresses an action (such as eat)', '"Dance" can be a verb because it''s an action word.', '“跳舞”可以是一个动词，因为它是一个表示动作的词。', '', 'v[er]b'),
('behalf', '/bɪˈhæf/', 'n.代表（某人），因为某人', 'as the representative of somebody or instead of them', 'Lord Bao attended the conference on behalf of Baicizhan.', '包大人代表百词斩参加了这次会议。', '', 'be-h[al]f'),
('diesel', '/ˈdiːzl/', 'n.内燃机，柴油机', 'a type of heavy oil used as a fuel instead of petrol/gas; a vehicle that uses diesel fuel', 'The man is filling the diesel truck at the gas station.', '那个男人正在加油站给柴油货车加油。', '', 'dies[el]'),
('telegraph', '/ˈtelɪɡræf/', 'n.电报', 'a method of sending messages over long distances', 'The soldier sends the message by telegraph.', '士兵用电报发送消息。', 'tele远 + graph写，图 → 从远方写来 → telegraph电报', 't[el]e-graph'),
('manifest', '/ˈmænɪfest/', 'v.使显现，使显露，表明', 'to show something clearly', 'She manifested signs of a fever.', '她表现出发烧的迹象。', 'mani手 + fest打击 → 用手打出 → manifest表明；证实', 'ma-n[i]-fest'),
('sew', '/soʊ/', 'v.缝，缝纫', 'to use a needle and thread to make stitches in cloth', 'A sewing machine can sew so much faster than my hand.', '缝纫机比手工缝制快多了。', '', 's[ew]'),
('downward', '/ˈdaʊnwərd/', 'adv.向下', 'from a higher place or level to a lower place or level', 'The soldiers are falling downward through the air.', '士兵们正从空中降落下来。', 'down向下 ＋ ward向... → downward向下地', 'down-w[ar]d'),
('slippery', '/ˈslɪpəri/', 'adj.滑的', 'difficult to hold or to stand or move on', 'Watch out! The ground is slippery!', '小心！地面很滑！', 'slip滑（重读闭音节，双写p） + er名词词尾 + y形容词词尾→ slippery滑的，使人滑跤的', 'slipp[er]y'),
('unjust', '/ˌʌnˈdʒʌst/', 'adj.不公平的', 'not fair or deserved', 'It was an unjust trial!', '这是一场不公平的审判！', 'un不 + just公平的 → unjust不公平的', '[un]-just'),
('responsible', '/rɪˈspɑːnsəbl/', 'adj.负有责任的', 'having the job or duty of doing something or taking care of somebody/something', 'The dog was responsible for this mess.', '这只狗要对这片混乱负责。', 'respons回应 + ible能...的 → 能回应的 → responsible有责任的', 're-spon-s[i]-[ble]'),
('admire', '/ədˈmaɪər/', 'v.钦佩，崇拜', 'to respect somebody for what they have done or to respect their qualities', 'The little boy admires the firemen and salutes them.', '小男孩很钦佩消防员并向他们敬礼。', 'ad关于 + mire感到惊讶 → admire钦佩', 'ad-m[ire]'),
('emancipate', '/ɪˈmænsɪpeɪt/', 'v.解放', '(formal) to free somebody', '"When we emancipated the slaves', '我们释放奴隶时，他们弄断手铐获得了自由。', 'e出 ＋ man手 ＋ cip握住 ＋ ate提前抓住 → 预料 → emancipate解放', 'e-m[an]-c[i]-pate'),
('female', '/ˈfiːmeɪl/', 'adj.女性的；  n.女子', 'of the sex that gives birth to young; being a woman or a girl ', 'This is a pink symbol representing female characteristics.', '这是个代表女性特征的粉色标志。', 'fem=female女，妇女 + ale → female女的，雌性的动物；女子', 'fe-m[al]e'),
('coincidence', '/kəʊˈɪnsɪdəns/', 'n.巧合，巧事', 'the fact of two things happening at the same time by chance', 'They both are wearing suspender trousers today—what a coincidence!', '她们俩今天都穿着背带裤，真是太巧了！', 'co共同 + in进 + cid落下 + ence名词后缀 → coincidence巧合', 'co-[in]-ci-d[en]ce'),
('theft', '/θeft/', 'n.偷盗，盗窃', 'the crime of stealing something from a person or place', '"Theft is everywhere', '盗窃无处不在，甚至网上也有。', '', '[th]eft'),
('fool', '/fuːl/', 'v.欺骗', 'a person who you think behaves or speaks in a way that lacks intelligence or good judgement', 'The man fools others through phone calls.', '这个人通过电话来欺骗他人。', '', 'fo[ol]'),
('adolescent', '/ˌædəˈlesnt/', 'n.青少年', 'a young person who is developing from a child into an adult', 'Acne is common among adolescents.', '青少年长粉刺很普遍。', '"adolesc进入青春期 + ent表示具有……性质的，关于……的 → 青春期的', 'ado-[le]s-cent'),
('effective', '/ɪˈfektɪv/', 'adj.有效的', 'producing the result that is wanted or intended; producing a successful result', 'The medicine she took was effective for treating colds.', '她吃的药对治疗感冒很有效。', 'ef出 ＋ fect做，制作 ＋ ive形容词后缀 → 做出来的 → effective有效的', 'e[ff]ec-tive'),
('frequently', '/ˈfriːkwəntli/', 'adv.经常地', 'many times at short intervals', 'He went to the bathroom frequently after drinking too much water.', '喝了太多水后，他经常去上厕所。', 'frequent经常的 ＋ ly...地 → frequently经常地，频繁地', 'fre-[que]nt-ly'),
('eventually', '/ɪˈventʃuəli/', 'adv.终于，最后', 'at some later time; in the end', '"After weeks of hard study', '经过几周的刻苦学习，他终于得到了令人满意的结果。', 'eventual最后的 + ly 表示方式、程度、状态、“...地” → adv.终于；最后', 'even-tu-[al]ly'),
('rotary', '/ˈroʊtəri/', 'adj.旋转的', '(of a movement) moving in a circle around a central fixed point', 'The blades of a helicopter move in a rotary motion as it is flying.', '直升机在飞行时，桨叶做旋转运动。', 'rot轮，转+ary名词及形容词后缀 →旋转的', 'Ro-t[ar]y'),
('turning', '/ˈtɜːrnɪŋ/', 'n.转弯处', 'a place where a road leads away from the one you are travelling on', 'Slow down before turning.', '转弯前要减速。', 'turn转 + ing名词后缀 → turning转向；旋转', 'turn-[ing]'),
('romantic', '/roʊˈmæntɪk/', 'adj.浪漫的', 'connected or concerned with love or a sexual relationship;', '"On Valentine\\u0027s Day', '情人节这天，情侣们通常会出去吃一顿浪漫的晚餐。', 'roman浪漫 + tic……的 → romantic浪漫的', 'ro-m[an]-tic'),
('mathematics', '/ˌmæθəˈmætɪks/', 'n.（=maths）数学', 'the science of numbers', 'My favorite subject in school was mathematics.', '在学校，我最喜欢的课是数学。', 'mathemat=mathematic数学的 + ics名词后缀 → mathematics数学', 'ma[th]-e-m[a]t-ics'),
('divorce', '/dɪˈvɔːrs/', 'n.离婚，离异；  v.离婚', 'the legal ending of a marriage; a separation; the ending of a relationship between two things', 'The couple have agreed to get a divorce.', '这对夫妻已经同意离婚了。', 'di使…变成、分开 + vorce=vert转 → 从伴侣身边转开 → 离婚', 'di-v[or]ce'),
('sober', '/ˈsoʊbər/', 'adj.未饮醉的，清醒的；  v.使清醒', 'not drunk (= not affected by alcohol)', '"As the driver tonight', '今晚我要开车，为了保持清醒，我绝不能喝酒。', 'so分开，没有 + ber喝醉的 → 没有喝醉的 → sober清醒的', 'sob[er]'),
('density', '/ˈdensəti/', 'n.密度', 'the quality of being dense; the degree to which something is dense', 'High density housing can accommodate many people in a small area.', '高密度的住房供给可以在一个小区域内容纳很多人居住。', 'dens稠密的 + ity名词后缀表性质 → 稠密 → density稠度，密度', 'd[en]-si-ty'),
('regular', '/ˈreɡjələr/', 'adj.定期的，有规律的；正常的', 'following a pattern', 'We have a regular meeting on every Monday morning.', '我们每个星期一早晨都有例会。', 'reg国王 + ular……的 → 国王统治的 → regular规则的', 're-gu-l[ar]'),
('actress', '/ˈæktrəs/', 'n.女演员', 'a woman who performs on the stage', 'The actress is practising her line on the stage.', '这位女演员正在舞台上练习她的台词。', 'act表演 + ress女性 → actress女演员', 'ac-tr[e]ss'),
('treat', '/triːt/', 'v.对待；治疗；视为', 'to give medical care or attention to a person', 'The girl treats the dogs with kindness.', '那个女孩对待狗狗们很亲切。', '', 'tr[ea]t'),
('deadlock', '/ˈdedlɑːk/', 'n.僵局', 'a situation in which players', 'Talks between the two sides ended in deadlock.', '双方的谈判陷入了僵局。', 'dead死的+lock锁 → 僵局，停顿', 'dead-lo[ck]'),
('publish', '/ˈpʌblɪʃ/', 'v.发表；出版；公布', 'to produce a book', 'They are making sure every book to be published is perfect.', '他们在确保每一本即将发表的书都是完美的。', 'publ公众 + ish动词后缀 → 使面向公众 → publish出版', 'pub-li[sh]'),
('discussion', '/dɪˈskʌʃn/', 'n.讨论，谈论', 'the process of discussing somebody/something; a conversation about somebody/something', 'The teacher and kids are in a discussion about the Earth.', '老师和孩子们在进行一场关于地球的讨论。', 'discuss讨论 + ion名词后缀 → discussion讨论', 'dis-cuss[ion]'),
('interview', '/ˈɪntərvjuː/', 'n.面试；  v.采访', 'a formal meeting at which somebody is asked questions to see if they are suitable for a particular job', 'The man is giving a job interview.', '男子正在进行工作面试。', 'inter互相 + view看见 → interview会见', 'in-t[er]-view'),
('solve', '/sɑːlv/', 'v.解决，处理', 'to find a way of dealing with a problem or difficult situation', 'He is trying to solve this hard problem. ', '他正在努力想解决这个麻烦的问题。', 'so反身代词 + lv松开，分开 + e → solve解决', 'solv[e]'),
('pond', '/pɑːnd/', 'n.池塘', 'a small area of still water', 'The duck dived into the pond.', '鸭子一头扎进了池塘。', '', 'p[on]d'),
('eternal', '/ɪˈtɜːrnl/', 'adj.永恒的，永不改变的', 'without an end; existing or continuing forever', 'The lock and key symbolize the eternal love of the couple.', '锁和钥匙象征着恋人之间永恒的爱。', 'etern年龄很大 + al表形容词 → eternal永远的', 'eter-n[al]'),
('handy', '/ˈhændi/', 'adj.方便的', 'easy to use or to do', 'My daddy has many handy tools.', '我爸爸有很多简便的工具。', 'hand手 + y形容词后缀 → handy手巧的，伸手可及的', 'h[an]dy'),
('poison', '/ˈpɔɪzn/', 'v.毒死，毒害', 'a substance that causes death or harm if it is swallowed or absorbed into the body; an idea', 'The princess was poisoned by the apple.	', '公主被苹果毒死了。', '', 'p[oi]-son'),
('confess', '/kənˈfes/', 'v.（向神父或上帝）忏悔', 'to admit something that you feel ashamed or embarrassed about; to admit', '"Father', '神父，我在此忏悔我所有的罪行。', 'con全部 + fess说 → 全部说出 → confess承认，坦白', 'c[on]-fess'),
('misunderstand', '/ˌmɪsʌndərˈstænd/', 'v.误解，误会', 'to fail to understand somebody/something correctly', 'He misunderstood the way of making smoked meat.', '他误解了做烟熏肉的方法。', 'mis错误，坏 + understand理解 → misunderstand误解', 'mis-[u]n-d[er]-stand'),
('donkey', '/ˈdɔːŋki/', 'n.驴', 'an animal of the horse family', 'The donkey is trying to eat a carrot.', '这头驴子正在努力吃一根胡萝卜。', '', 'don-k[ey]'),
('jelly', '/ˈdʒeli/', 'n.果冻，肉冻', 'a cold sweet transparent food made from gelatin', 'Have a taste of my homemade orange jelly.', '尝尝我自制的橙子果冻吧。', '', 'j[el]ly'),
('marvelous', '/ˈmɑːrvələs/', 'adj.叹为观止的，令人惊奇的', 'extremely good; wonderful', '"It is the most marvelous fireworks show!" the girl exclaimed.', '“这是最叹为观止的烟花表演！”这个女孩惊叹道。', 'marvel奇迹 + ous……的 → marvelous奇迹般的；了不起的', 'mar-v[el]ous'),
('Fahrenheit', '/ˈfærənhaɪt/', 'n.华氏度', 'the scale of temperature in which water freezes at 32° and boils at 212°', '"The temperature is 37 degrees Celsius', '温度是37摄氏度，大约是99华氏度。', '', 'Fahren-h[ei]t'),
('wield', '/wiːld/', 'v.使用', 'to hold something', 'He is looking for the enemy while wielding a gun .', '他一边拿着枪，一边在寻找敌人。', '', 'wi[el]d'),
('veil', '/veɪl/', 'n.面纱', 'a covering of very thin transparent material worn', 'Lift the veil so I can see your beautiful face.', '把面纱掀起来，这样我才能看到你美丽的脸。', 'veil=cover盖上 → veil面纱，借口', 'v[ei]l'),
('cycle', '/ˈsaɪkəl/', 'n.周期，循环', 'the fact of a series of events being repeated many times', 'You can learn the water cycle from this picture.', '你能从这张图上学到水循环的过程。', '', 'cy-[cle]'),
('stout', '/staʊt/', 'adj.矮胖的', '(of a person) rather fat', 'The boy is quite stout for his age.', '对于这个年龄的人来说，这个男孩太过肥胖了。', '', 'st[ou]t'),
('observer', '/əbˈzɜːrvər/', 'n.观察者；监视者', 'a person who watches somebody/something; a person who watches and studies particular events', 'The little boy wants to become a star observer in the future.', '这个小男孩以后想成为一名观星者。', '"ob加强意义 + serv保持 + er表示人', 'ob-s[er]v-er'),
('minimal', '/ˈmɪnɪməl/', 'adj.最小的', 'very small in size or amount; as small as possible', 'The first apple on the left is the minimal one.', '左侧的第一个苹果是最小的。', 'minim小 + al形容词后缀 → minimal最小的', 'mi-ni-m[al]'),
('insufficient', '/ˌɪnsəˈfɪʃnt/', 'adj.不足的', 'not large', 'One pea?! This meal is totally insufficient.', '只有一个豌豆？这顿饭完全不够吃。', 'in不 ＋ suf在下面 ＋ fici做 ＋ ent...的 → in不 ＋ sufficient在下面做好的=充足的 → insufficient不足的', 'in-suffi-c[ie]nt'),
('unkind', '/ˌʌnˈkaɪnd/', 'adj.不仁慈的，不厚道的，不和善的', 'unpleasant or unfriendly; slightly cruel', 'I don''t understand why my boss is so unkind to me.', '我不明白为什么老板对我如此不友好。', 'un不，没有 ＋ kind善良的 → unkind不和善的', 'un-k[ind]'),
('affix', '"/əˈfɪks/', 'v.粘上', 'to stick or attach something to something else', 'The girl affixed her new award to the wall.', '小女孩把她的新奖状粘到了墙上。', 'af一再 + fix固定 → 固定上去 → 附加；贴上', '[a]ffix'),
('dispense', '/dɪˈspens/', 'v.分发，分配', 'to give out something to people; to provide something', 'The Red Cross dispensed food to the poor families.', '红十字会在向贫困家庭分发食品。', 'dis分开，分离 + pense花费 → 分开花费 → 分配', 'dis-p[en]se'),
('bosom', '/ˈbʊzəm/', 'n.胸部，胸怀，内部，内心', 'a woman’s chest or breasts', 'She held the child to her bosom.', '她把孩子抱在胸前。', '', 'bo-s[o]m'),
('doze', '/doʊz/', 'v.瞌睡，假寐', 'to sleep lightly for a short time', 'I dozed a little at work today because I was so tired.', '今天工作的时候，我打了会儿瞌睡，因为我太累了。', '', 'doz[e]'),
('Marxism', '/ˈmɑːrksɪzəm/', 'n.马克思主义', 'the political and economic theories of Karl Marx (1818–83) which explain the changes and developments in society as the result of opposition between the social classes', 'Marxism and capitalism are very different economic ideas.', '马克思主义和资本主义是两种非常不同的经济理论。', '', 'M[ar]x-ism'),
('notice', '/ˈnoʊtɪs/', 'v.注意到，意识到', 'information that tells you or warns you about something that is going to happen', 'Please notice the safety notice on the wall.', '请注意墙上的安全通知。', 'not知道 + ice名词后缀 → notice 通知', 'n[o]-tice'),
('tone', '/toʊn/', 'n.语气', 'the quality of a sound', 'The little boy learned to use a more polite tone when speaking to his mother.', '这个小男孩学会用更礼貌的语气和母亲说话。', '', 't[on]e'),
('stance', '/stæns/', 'n.立场', 'a publicly stated opinion', 'Their stance is that protecting the Earth is everyone''s responsibility.', '他们的立场是保护地球人人有责。', 'stan站 + ce表名词 → stance立场', 'st[an]ce'),
('intangible', '/ɪnˈtændʒəbl/', 'adj.无形的', 'that exists but that is difficult to describe', 'Knowledge is an intangible asset.', '知识是无形的资产。', 'in不 ＋ tang=tangent正切 ＋ ible形容词后缀 → intangible触摸不到的', 'in-t[an]-gi-[ble]'),
('fury', '/ˈfjʊri/', 'n.狂怒，暴怒', 'extreme anger that often includes violent behaviour; a state of being extremely angry about something', 'He was full of fury when he saw that message.', '当看到那条信息时，他愤怒不已。', '', 'f[ur]y'),
('viewpoint', '/ˈvjuːpɔɪnt/', 'n.观点，视点，见解，角度', 'a way of thinking about a subject; a direction or place from which you look at something', 'The man is thinking about his viewpoints and is ready to write them down.', '这个男人正在思考他的观点并准备写下来。', 'view看 ＋ point点 → viewpoint观点，看法', 'v[ie]w-point'),
('parole', '/pəˈroʊl/', 'n.假释', 'permission given to a prisoner to leave prison before the end of a sentence usually as a reward for behaving well', '"When on parole', '在保释期，被释放的囚犯必须遵守相关条件。', '', 'pa-ro[le]'),
('labour', '/ˈleɪbər/', 'n.（体力）劳动', 'to do hard physical work', 'Many people make a living by doing manual labour.', '许多人靠从事繁重的劳动谋生。', '', 'lab[our]'),
('rest', '/rest/', 'n.休息，休息时间；剩余部分；  v.基于，以…...为基础；休息，放松', 'a period of time in which you relax', 'On Sunday I like to sleep late and get more rest.', '星期天我喜欢睡懒觉，多休息会儿。', '', 'r[e]st'),
('hospital', '/ˈhɑspɪtl/', 'n.医院', 'a large building where people who are ill/sick or injured are given medical treatment and care', 'The patient was taken to the hospital for treatment.', '病人被带进医院进行治疗。', 'hospit客人 + al名词词尾 → 客气对待病人的地方 → hospital医院', 'hos-pi-t[al]');
INSERT INTO `cet6_word` (`word`, `phonetic`, `translate`, `definition_en`, `example_en`, `example_cn`, `mnemonic`, `cloze`) VALUES
('military', '/ˈmɪləteri/', 'adj.军事的', 'connected with soldiers or the armed forces', 'University freshmen are required to participate in military training.', '大学新生要参加军训。', 'milit兵 + ary……的 → military军人的，军队的', 'mi-li-t[ar]y'),
('player', '/ˈpleɪər/', 'n.玩家；参赛选手，队员', 'a person who takes part in a game or sport', 'The player has just won a game.', '这个玩家刚刚赢得了一场游戏。', 'play比赛，游戏 + er表人 → player选手，队员', 'play-[er]'),
('draw', '/drɔː/', 'v.绘画；吸引；引起，激起；拖，拉', 'to make (a picture', 'The girls are sitting on the ground drawing pictures.', '女孩们正坐在地上画画。', '', 'dr[aw]'),
('abreast', '/əˈbrest/', 'adv.并肩地，并列地', 'used to describe two or more people or things that are next to each other in a line', 'These boys are walking abreast in the game.', '这几个男孩在比赛中并肩前行。', 'a在… + breast胸膛 → 胸膛在一条线上 → abreast 并列', 'abr[ea]st'),
('watertight', '/ˈwɔːtərtaɪt/', 'adj.不透水的', 'that does not allow water to get in or out', '"My boots', '我的靴子、雨衣和雨伞都不透水，所以我不会在雨中被淋湿。', 'water水 + tight紧的 → watertight防水的；无懈可击', 'wa-ter-t[igh]t'),
('care', '/ker/', 'n.照顾，照料；小心，谨慎；  v.在意；关心', 'the process of caring for somebody/something and providing what they need for their health or protection', 'The nurse is taking care of the old man.', '这名护士正在照顾老人。', '', 'c[are]'),
('serious', '/ˈsɪriəs/', 'adj.严重的；认真的，严肃的', 'bad or dangerous', 'There was a serious car accident on the road.', '路上发生了一起严重的车祸。', '', 'se-ri-[ou]s'),
('plane', '/pleɪn/', 'n. 飞机', 'a vehicle that has wings and an engine and can carry people or things in the air', 'The plane is taking off at sunset.', '飞机在日落时分起飞。', '', 'pl[an]e'),
('force', '/fɔrs/', 'n.力量；武力；影响力；  v.强迫；促使，迫使', 'to make somebody do something that they do not want to do', 'The force of many people together is greater than that of just one.', '人多力量大。', '', 'f[or]ce'),
('fun', '/fʌn/', 'adj.有趣的，好玩的；  n.娱乐，乐趣，快乐', 'enjoyment; pleasure; a thing that gives enjoyment or pleasure and makes you feel happy', 'The baby thought it was great fun to play with her dad.', '小宝宝觉得和她爸爸一起玩很有趣。', '', 'f[un]'),
('inherent', '/ɪnˈhɪrənt/', 'adj.内在的，固有的', 'that is a basic or permanent part of somebody/something and that cannot be removed', 'Confidence is an inherent quality of this man.', '自信是这个男人的内在品质。', 'in里面 + her粘附 + ent有...性质的 → 天生与身体内连着 → 天赋的，生来的', 'in-h[er]-ent'),
('start', '/stɑːrt/', 'v.开始，发生；  n.开端，起点', 'to begin doing or using something', 'The running race starts!', '赛跑开始了！', '', 'st[ar]t'),
('key', '/kiː/', 'adj.关键的，主要的；  n.方法，手段；键', 'a specially shaped piece of metal used for locking a door', 'Her ideas were key to their success.', '她的主意是他们成功的关键所在。', '', 'k[ey]'),
('borrow', '/ˈbɔːrəʊ/', 'v.借用；借，借入', 'to take and use (something that belongs to someone else) for a period of time before returning it', 'He borrowed a famous quote from Shakespeare in his speech.', '他在演讲中借用了莎士比亚的一句名言。', '', 'b[or]row'),
('report', '/rɪˈpɔːrt/', 'n.报告，汇报；报道；  v.报告，汇报；报道', 'a written or spoken description of a situation', 'This woman is making a report on the new project.', '这位女士在做关于新项目的汇报。', 're回 + port拿，带 → 把消息、情况等带回来 → report报告，汇报', 're-p[or]t'),
('grape', '/ɡreɪp/', 'n.葡萄', 'a small green or purple fruit that grows in bunches on a climbing plant (called a vine). Wine is made from grapes.', 'These grapes would soon be turned into expensive wine.', '这些葡萄很快会被制成昂贵的葡萄酒。', '', 'gr[a]pe'),
('dare', '/der/', 'v.敢于', '(not usually used in the progressive tenses) to be brave enough to do something', 'He dares to stay on the horse.', '他敢待在那匹马背上。', '', 'd[are]'),
('beautiful', '/ˈbjuːtɪfl/', 'adj.美丽的，美好的', 'having beauty; pleasing to the senses or to the mind', 'She looks beautiful in her new black shirt.', '她穿着新买的黑色衬衫，真好看。', 'beauti美丽 + ful……的 → beautiful美的，美丽的', 'be[au]-ti-ful'),
('snake', '/sneɪk/', 'n.蛇', 'a reptile with a very long thin body and no legs. ', 'This is a cute cartoon snake.', '这是一条可爱的卡通蛇。', '', 'sn[a]ke'),
('haircut', '/ˈherkʌt/', 'n.理发', 'the act of somebody cutting your hair', 'This is the baby''s first ever haircut.', '这个宝宝第一次理发。', 'hair头发 + cut剪 → 理发', 'h[air]-cut'),
('miss', '/mɪs/', 'v.错过；怀念，思念；未察觉', 'to fail to hit', 'All my shots missed the target.', '我每发射击都错过了目标。', '', 'm[i]ss'),
('hour', '/ˈaʊər/', 'n.小时；时间，时刻', 'one of the 24 equal parts of a day; 60 minutes', 'I get a break at one o''clock—only an hour to go!', '一点的时候我可以休息一下，只有一个小时！', '', 'h[our]'),
('properly', '/ˈprɑːpərli/', 'adv.正确地；适当地', 'in a way that is acceptable or suitable', 'You should dress properly to attend the party.', '你应该正确地穿着才能去参加派对。', 'proper恰当的 + ly...地 → properly正确地；恰当地', 'prop-[er]-ly'),
('anywhere', '/ˈeniwer/', 'pron.任何（一个）地方', 'used in negative sentences and in questions instead of somewhere', 'You can connect to the internet from anywhere in the world.', '你可以从世界上的任何地方连接到互联网。', 'any任何 + where哪里 → anywhere无论何处', 'any-wh[ere]'),
('black', '/blæk/', 'adj.黑色的', 'having the very darkest colour', 'Her shiny black hair is beautiful.', '她的闪亮黑发很美。', '', 'bla[ck]'),
('desk', '/desk/', 'n.书桌，办公桌', 'a piece of furniture like a table', 'There is an empty desk right here.', '这儿有一张空的桌子。', '', 'd[e]sk'),
('appoint', '/əˈpɔɪnt/', 'v.委派，任命', 'to choose (someone) to have a particular job; to give (someone) a position or duty', 'My boss has appointed me to manage this project.', '我的老板已任命我来管理这个项目。', 'ap加强 + point指 → appoint指定；任命', 'app[oi]nt'),
('whether', '/ˈweðər/', 'conj.是否；不管，无论', 'used to show that something is true in either of two cases', 'She hasn''t decided whether to eat this cake or not.', '她还没决定是否要吃掉这个蛋糕。', 'whe=who谁 + ther比较级后缀 → 是两人中的谁 → whether是否', 'whe[th]er'),
('nitrogen', '/ˈnaɪtrədʒən/', 'n.氮，氮气', 'a chemical element. Nitrogen is a gas that is found in large quantities in the earth’s atmosphere. ', 'Nitrogen makes up most of Earth''s atmosphere.', '组成地球大气层的绝大部分气体是氮气。', 'nitro硝基 + gen出生，产生 → nitrogen氮', 'ni-tro-[ge]n'),
('shine', '/ʃaɪn/', 'v.照耀，闪光', 'to give off light', 'The sun is shining in the sky.', '太阳在天空中熠熠闪光。', '', '[sh]ine'),
('let', '/let/', 'v.允许；  n.出租', 'to allow somebody to do something or something to happen without trying to stop it', 'The waiter opened the door and let customers in.', '服务生打开了门让顾客进去。', '', '[le]t'),
('very', '/ˈveri/', 'adv.很，非常', 'used before adjectives', 'They are very excited.', '他们非常激动。', '', 'v[er]y'),
('oxide', '/ˈɑːksaɪd/', 'n.氧化物', '', 'Oxygen in the air causes iron oxide to form on these bolts.', '空气中的氧气使这些螺栓上形成了氧化铁。', '', 'ox-id[e]'),
('physiological', '/ˌfɪziəˈlɑdʒɪkəl/', 'adj.生理的，生理学的', 'connected with the scientific study of the normal functions of living things; connected with the way in which a particular living thing functions', 'The teacher is giving a lesson about physiological knowledge.', '老师在上一堂关于生理知识的课。', 'physio生理 + logical形容词后缀: 学科的 → physiological生理的，生理学的', 'phy-si-o-l[o]-gi-c[al]'),
('pinch', '/pɪntʃ/ ', 'v.捏，掐，夹痛', 'to take a piece of somebody’s skin between your thumb and first finger and squeeze hard', 'He pinched his nose to avoid the bad smell.', '他捏住鼻子来避开臭味。', '', 'p[in]ch'),
('plumber', '/ˈplʌmər/', 'n.管道工，水管工人', 'a person whose job is to fit and repair things such as water pipes', 'The plumber is trying to fix the sink.', '水管工正在修理水槽。', 'plumb铅锤 + er人，不少管道用铅做成 → 修管道的人 → plumber管道工', 'plumb[er]'),
('arrogant', '/ˈærəɡənt/ ', 'adj.傲慢的，妄自尊大的', 'behaving in a proud', 'The arrogant man refused to listen to anyone else''s ideas.', '那个傲慢的男人拒绝听从其他人的想法。', 'ar一再 + rog要求，问 + ant……的 → 一再要求的 → arrogant傲慢的', '[ar]ro-gant'),
('repel', '/rɪˈpel/', 'v.排斥，抵制；击退，驱逐', 'if one thing repels another', 'Like poles repel; unlike poles attract.', '同极相斥，异极相吸。', 're向后，相反 + pel推 → 推着向后退 → repel击退，逐回', 're-p[el]'),
('royalty', '/ˈrɔɪəlti/', 'n.皇家，王族', 'one or more members of a royal family', 'Crowns are a symbol of royalty.', '皇冠是皇家的象征。', 'royal皇家的 + ty名词后缀 → royalty王位，王权', 'roy-[al]-ty'),
('slam', '/slæm/', 'v.猛烈撞击', 'to shut', 'This car slammed into a pole.', '这辆车撞到了电线杆。', '', 'sl[a]m'),
('tactics', '/''tæktɪks/', 'n.战术，策略', 'the particular method you use to achieve something; the art of moving soldiers and military equipment around during a battle or war in order to use them in the most effective way', 'The coach devised different tactics before our football game.', '教练在我们的足球比赛前制定了不同的战术。', 'tact接触 + ics名词后缀，学科 → 接触别人的学问 → 策略', 'tac-t[i]cs'),
('autobiography', '/ˌɔːtəbaɪˈɑːɡrəfi/', 'n.自传', 'the story of a person’s life', 'This entrepreneur''s autobiography inspired me a lot.', '这位企业家的自传给了我很大的启发。', 'auto自己 + bio生命，生物 + graphy记述 → 记述自己的人生 → autobiography自传', '[au]-to-bi-[o]g-ra-phy'),
('bankrupt', '/ˈbæŋkrʌpt/', 'adj.破产的', 'without enough money to pay what you owe; completely lacking in anything that has value', '"With no more money', '没有钱，我彻底破产了。', 'bank柜台 + rupt断裂 → 柜台断了 → 破产了 → bankrupt破产的', 'ba[nk]-rupt'),
('commute', '/kəˈmjuːt/', 'n.通勤，在两地之间乘车往返', 'to travel regularly by bus', 'The shuttle bus makes my commute to work convenient.', '班车让我上下班很方便。', 'com和，一起 + mute改变 -> commute两地往返', 'commut[e]'),
('bulk', '/bʌlk/', 'n.大批；容量；体积； 巨大的体重（或重量、形状、身体等）；  adj.大量的；散装的；  v.膨胀；显得重要', 'the (large) size or quantity of something', 'Buying tomatoes in bulk is more economical than buying in small quantities.', '批量采购番茄比少量购买实惠很多。', '', 'b[u]lk'),
('client', '/ˈklaɪənt/', 'n.委托人，当事人，客户', 'a person who uses the services or advice of a professional person or organization', 'My client asked me to find out the murderer.', '我的委托人要求我找出凶手。', '', 'cl[ie]nt'),
('declare', '/dɪˈkler/', 'v.宣布，宣告', 'to say something officially or publicly', 'The priest declared the couple husband and wife.', '这个牧师宣布这对男女正式结成夫妻。', 'de加强 + clare（拉丁语）澄清 → declare表明，声明', 'de-cl[are]'),
('strategic', '/strəˈtiːdʒɪk/', 'adj.战略（上）的，对全局有重要意义的，关键的', 'done as part of a plan that is meant to achieve a particular purpose or to gain an advantage; connected with getting an advantage in a war or other military situation', 'Shanghai is of strategic importance to the international trade of China.', '上海这座城市对中国的国际贸易具有重要的战略意义。', 'strateg战略 + ic形容词后缀 → strategic战略(上)的', 'str[a]te-gic'),
('hardware', '/ˈhɑrdwer/', 'n.（计算机）硬件', 'things (such as tools or parts of machines) that are made of metal; the machinery and electronic parts of a computer system', 'He is fixing the hardware of a computer.', '他正在修理计算机的硬件。', 'hard硬 + ware物件 → hardware五金器具', 'hard-w[are]'),
('compose', '/kəmˈpoʊz/', 'v.作曲；形成，构成', 'to create and write (a piece of music or writing); to combine together to form a whole', 'The man is composing a new song on the keyboard.', '这位男士正在用他的电子琴创作新歌。', 'com一起 + pose放 → compose组成，构成；创作', 'com-pos[e]'),
('freely', '/ˈfriːli/', 'adv.自由地', 'in a free manner', 'The hens range freely about the farm.', '母鸡们在农场里自由活动。', '', ''),
('worthwhile', '/ˌwɜːrθˈwaɪl/', 'adj.值得的，有意义的', 'important', 'Studying English words with this app is definitely worthwhile!', '用这款应用学英语单词绝对超值哦！', 'worth有...价值 + while一段时间 → worthwhile值得的', ''),
('given', '/ˈɡɪvn/', 'prep.考虑到；  adj.指定的，特定的；假设的；  v.给，给予（give的过去分词）', 'an assumption that is taken for granted', '"Given that she is only three years old', '考虑到她只有三岁，她已经画得很好了。', '', ''),
('morality', '/məˈræləti/', 'n.道德，道德观', 'principles concerning right and wrong or good and bad behaviour; the degree to which something is right or wrong', 'Talking on a mobile phone while watching a movie shows a lack of morality.', '看电影时接电话表现出缺乏道德。', 'mor道德 + ality表示状态、情况、性质 → morality道德观', 'm[or]a-li-ty'),
('petition', '/ pəˈtɪʃən /', 'n.请愿书；祈求；  v.请愿', 'a written document signed by a large number of people that asks somebody in a position of authority to do or to change something', 'The villagers signed a petition asking for a new school.', '村民们签署了一份请愿书，希望开办新学校。', 'pet追寻，寻求 + ition表名词，行为过程 → 追寻状态 → petition请愿', 'pe-ti-t[ion]'),
('decrease', '"/dɪˈkriːs/', 'v.减少；降低；  n.降低', 'to become or make something become smaller in size', '"Our sales have decreased for the last two years', '过去两年我们的销售额都在减少，现在我们没钱了。', 'de向下 + crease增长 → 向下增加 → 减少', 'de-cr[ea]se'),
('clash', '/klæʃ/', 'v.发生冲突', 'to hit together and make a loud ringing noise; to make two metal objects do this', 'The couple clashed over who should wash the dishes.', '这对情侣为谁该洗碗的问题发生了冲突。', '', 'cla[sh]'),
('freight', '/freɪt/', 'n.货运', 'the carrying of goods by some means of transport', 'The freight train transports the goods.', '货运列车用于运送货物。', '', 'fr[eigh]t'),
('biography', '/baɪˈɑːɡrəfi/', 'n.传记文学，传记', 'the story of a person’s life written by somebody else; this type of writing', '"On the shelf', '你可以在书架上找到许多名人传记。', 'bio生命 + graphy记述 → 记录生平 → biography传记', 'bi-[o]g-r[a]-phy'),
('shatter', '/ˈʃætər/', 'v.（使）粉碎，破碎', 'to suddenly break into small pieces; to make something suddenly break into small pieces', 'She dropped the bottle and it shattered into pieces on the floor.', '她把瓶子掉在地上摔得粉碎。', '', 'Shatt[er]'),
('cumulative', '/ˈkjuːmjələtɪv/', 'adj.累积的', 'having a result that increases in strength or importance each time more of something is added', 'We saw a cumulative increase in sales.', '我们看到销售呈累积增长。', 'cumulat(e)累计 + ive形容词后缀 → cumulative累计的', 'cu-m[u]-l[a]-tive'),
('purity', '/ˈpjʊrəti/', 'n.纯洁', 'the state or quality of being pure', 'White roses are a symbol of purity.', '白玫瑰是纯洁的象征。', 'pur纯洁 + ity名词后缀 → 纯净；纯正', 'pu-r[i]-ty'),
('finite', '/ˈfaɪnaɪt/', 'adj.有限的', 'having a definite limit or fixed size', '"The set is finite in size', '这个集是有限的，因为它只有四个数字。', 'fin结束，范围 + ite表形容词 → 有范围的 → finite有限的', 'f[i]-nite'),
('qualitative', '/ˈkwɒlɪˌteɪtɪv/', 'adj.（性）质的，定性的', 'connected with what something is like or how good it is', 'Changes in temperature can lead to qualitative differences.', '温度的变化引起了质的差异。', 'qualit=quality质量 + ative形容词后缀 → qualitative（性）质的，定性的', 'q[ua]-li-t[a]-tive'),
('ecology', '/iˈkɑːlədʒi/', 'n.生态', 'the relation of plants and living creatures to each other and to their environment; the study of this', '"Animals', '动物、植物和人类构成了地球的生态。', 'eco生态 + logy…学 → ecology生态；生态学', 'e-c[o]-l[o]-gy'),
('flourish', '/ˈflɜːrɪʃ/', 'v.繁荣，兴旺', 'to grow well; to be healthy and happy', 'This place is  flourishing with each passing day.', '这个地方一天比一天繁荣。', 'flour花 + ish使成为，表动词 → 开花 →flourish繁荣，兴旺', 'fl[our]-ish'),
('clumsy', '/ˈklʌmzi/', 'adj.笨拙的，不灵活的', '(of people and animals) moving or doing things in a very awkward way', 'Why is there a clumsy elephant in the restaurant?', '为什么餐厅里有一头笨拙的大象？', '', 'cl[u]m-sy'),
('random', '/ˈrændəm/', 'adj.随机的；任意的；  n.随意，胡乱', 'done', 'It''s just a random series of numbers.', '这就是一系列随机的数字。', '', 'r[an]-dom'),
('dimension', '/dɪˈmɛnʃən/', 'n.维，维度', 'a measurement in space', 'These different shapes have three dimensions.', '这些不同的图形都是三维的。', 'di=dis不同的方向 + men测量 + ion名词后缀 → dimension维度', 'di-men-s[ion]'),
('extract', '"/ɪkˈstrækt/', 'v.取出', 'to remove or obtain a substance from something', 'The dentist decided to extract the broken tooth.', '牙医决定拔掉这颗坏掉的牙齿。', 'ex出，出去 + tract拉 → 拉出 → extract抽出，拔出', 'ex-tr[a]ct'),
('candidate', '/ˈkændɪdət/', 'n. 候选人，申请人', 'a person who is trying to be elected or is applying for a job', 'The candidates are giving a speech for their election.', '候选人正在为选举发表演说。', 'cand发光，白 + id + ate表名词  → 白衣人（古罗马时期谋求官职者都着白衣） → candidate候选人', 'can-d[i]-date'),
('score', '/skɔːr/', 'n.成绩；得分，分数；  v.得分', 'to win points', 'He is very happy for his high scores.', '他为他的好成绩感到非常高兴。', '', 'sc[ore]'),
('hospitality', '/ˌhɑːspɪˈtæləti/', 'n.好客；殷勤；宜人', 'friendly and generous behaviour towards guests', 'They show their hospitality by inviting us in.', '他们邀请我们进去以示好客。', 'hospit客人 + ality表性质名词 → 好客，殷勤', 'hos-p[i]-t[a]-li-ty'),
('manage', '/ˈmænɪdʒ/', 'v.管理；设法完成；有时间做，安排（时间）做；控制；处理', 'to control or be in charge of a business', 'He manages four people at the same time.', '他同时管理四个人。', 'man手工，亲手 + age → 动手操作 → manage管理', 'man-a[ge]'),
('exist', '/ɪɡˈzɪst/ ', 'v.存在；生存，生活', '(not used in the progressive tenses) to be real; to be present in a place or situation', 'Do aliens exist on other planets?', '其他星球上会有外星人存在吗？', 'ex出 + ist站立 → 站出来 → 活下来 → exist存在，生存', 'ex-[i]st'),
('opera', '/ˈɑːprə/', 'n.歌剧', 'a dramatic work in which all or most of the words are sung to music; works of this type as an art form or entertainment', 'The woman is performing a wonderful opera on the stage.', '那位女士正在舞台上表演一场精彩的歌剧。', '', 'op[er]a'),
('emphasis', '/ˈemfəsɪs/', 'n.强调；重视', 'special importance that is given to something', 'The dentist placed a great emphasis on teeth cleaning to the little girl.', '牙医向这个小女孩强调了刷牙的重要性。', 'em进入 + phasis显示 → 进入显示 → emphasis强调', 'em-[ph]a-sis'),
('upper', '/ˈʌpər/', 'adj.较高的，上面的', 'the top part of a shoe that is attached to the sole', '"The upper floor is the working area', '楼上是办公区域，楼下是接待处。', '', 'upp[er]'),
('republic', '/rɪˈpʌblɪk/', 'n.共和国，共和政体', 'a country that is governed by a president and politicians elected by the people and where there is no king or queen', 'France is a republic.', '法国是一个共和国。', 're事情，事务 + public公众  → 与公众相关的事务  → republic共和国', 're-p[u]b-lic'),
('acquire', '/əˈkwaɪər/', 'v. （通过努力、能力）获得；得到；患上（疾病）', 'to gain something by your own efforts', 'The student acquired his diploma upon graduation.', '一毕业，这位学生就获得了学位证。', 'ac加强 + quir寻求，询问 + e → acquire取得，学到', 'ac-q[uir]e'),
('edit', '/ˈedɪt/', 'v.剪辑', 'when somebody edits a film/movie', 'He is editing the film right now. He''ll edit out the unnecessary parts of the film.', '他正在剪辑电影，其中不必要的部分都会被他剪掉。', 'e出 + dit给予 → 给出好文章 → 编辑', 'ed-[i]t'),
('visual', '/ˈvɪʒuəl/', 'adj.视力的，视觉的；  n.视觉资料（指说明性的图片、影片等）', 'of or connected with seeing or sight', 'The theater was equipped with modern audio visual equipment.', '电影院配备着现代视听设备。', 'vis看 + ual表形容词 → visual视觉的', 'vi-su-[al]'),
('reside', '/rɪˈzaɪd/', 'v.居住', 'to live in a particular place', 'This type of crab resides inside shells.', '这种螃蟹住在贝壳里面。', 're再 + side坐 → 再坐之地 → reside居住', 'r[e]-side'),
('commence', '/kəˈmens/', 'v.开始', 'to begin to happen; to begin something', 'We were about to commence the race.', '我们就快开始比赛了。', 'com一起 + mence去(拉丁) → commence开始', 'comm[en]ce'),
('vein', '/veɪn/', 'n.静脉；血管；矿脉', 'any of the tubes that carry blood from all parts of the body towards the heart', 'The doctor restricts the blood flow in order to see the patient''s veins more clearly.', '医生限制了血液的流动，以便更清楚地看到病人的静脉。', '', 'v[ei]n'),
('astronomy', '/əˈstrɑːnəmi/', 'n.天文学', 'the scientific study of the sun', '"I\\u0027ve always loved looking at the stars', '我一直都很喜欢看星星，所以现在我研究天文学。', 'astro星星（宇宙相关的） + nomy某一领域的知识 → 研究星星的学科  → astronomy天文学', 'as-tr[o]-n[o]-my'),
('soluble', '/ˈsɑ:ljəbl/', 'adj.可溶解的', 'capable of being dissolved in a liquid', 'Instant coffee is soluble in hot water.', '速溶咖啡在热水中可以溶解。', 'solu=solute溶解 + ble形容词后缀 → soluble可溶的', 'so-lu-[ble]'),
('sow', '/soʊ/', 'v.播种；种', 'to plant or spread seeds in or on the ground', 'He is sowing seeds into the soil.', '他正在往土里播种。', '', 's[ow]'),
('nil', '/nɪl/', 'n.零', 'the number 0', '"The answer is nil - zip', '答案是零——没有，不存在。', '', 'n[i]l'),
('tangle', '/ˈtæŋɡl/', 'v.（使）缠结；（使）乱作一团', 'to twist something into an untidy mass; to become twisted in this way', 'Her hair is easy to get tangled.', '她的头发容易打结。', '', 'tan-[gle]'),
('atlas', '/ˈætləs/', 'n.地图集', 'a book of maps', 'The atlas contains information about all the countries in the world.', '地图集包含了世界上所有国家的信息。', '', 'At-l[a]s'),
('miserable', '/ˈmɪzrəbl/', 'adj.痛苦的，悲惨的	', 'very unhappy or uncomfortable', 'The man feels tired and miserable.', '这个男人感到疲倦和痛苦。', 'miser可怜 + able……的 → miserable可怜的', 'mis-er-a[ble]'),
('lawn', '/lɔːn/', 'n.草坪', 'an area of ground covered in short grass in a garden/yard or park', 'I often take care of my lawn to keep it nice and green.', '我常常精心打理我的草坪，让它看起来美观而又葱郁。', '', 'l[aw]n'),
('barber', '/ˈbɑːrbər/', 'n.（男）理发师', 'a person whose job is to cut men’s hair and sometimes to shave them; a shop where men can have their hair cut', 'I asked my barber to give me a new style this time.', '这一次我让我的理发师给我理一个新发型。', 'barb胡子 + er人 → 修理胡子的人 → barber理发师', 'b[ar]-ber'),
('threat', '/θret/', 'n.威胁，恐吓', 'a statement in which you tell somebody that you will punish or harm them', 'Don''t open the email! It''s definitely a threat to your information security.', '别打开这封邮件！它会对你的信息安全造成威胁。', '', '[th]reat'),
('equivalent', '/ɪˈkwɪvələnt/', 'adj.相等的', 'equal in value', 'The weight of three small balls is equivalent to that of this large one.', '三个小球的重量与这个大球的重量相等。', 'equi相等，平均 + val力量 + ent形容词后缀→ 力量平等 → 相等的，等价的', 'e-q[ui]-v[a]-lent'),
('instruction', '/ɪnˈstrʌkʃn/', 'n.指导；指令，命令；指示', 'the action or process of teaching; the act of instructing someone', 'The teacher gave instructions to his students.', '老师在指导学生。', 'instruct指导 + ion名词后缀 → instruction指导', 'in-struc-t[ion]'),
('defeat', '/dɪˈfiːt/', 'v.打败，击败，战胜', 'to win against somebody in a war', 'The girl skillfully defeated her challenger with a powerful kick.', '这个女孩一记飞踢，巧妙地将对手击败。', 'de向下 + feat做，制作 → 做下去 → 打下去 → defeat打败，摧毁', 'de-f[ea]t'),
('deaf', '/def/', 'adj.聋的', 'unable to hear anything or unable to hear very well', 'The girl is completely deaf; she can''t hear anything.', '这个女孩失聪了，什么也听不见。', '', 'd[ea]f'),
('inspection', '/ɪnˈspekʃn/', 'n.检查，细看', 'an official visit to a school', 'The mechanic gave the car a thorough inspection according to the check list.', '技工根据检查清单对汽车进行了一次全面检查。', 'inspect视察 + ion表名词 → 视察；认真看', 'in-spec-t[ion]');
INSERT INTO `cet6_word` (`word`, `phonetic`, `translate`, `definition_en`, `example_en`, `example_cn`, `mnemonic`, `cloze`) VALUES
('ballet', '/bæˈleɪ/', 'n.芭蕾舞，芭蕾舞剧', 'a style of dancing that tells a dramatic story with music but no talking or singing', 'Miss Elephant''s dream is to become a ballet dancer.', '大象小姐的梦想是成为一个芭蕾舞者。', 'ball舞蹈 + et名词后缀 → 舞蹈 → ballet芭蕾舞', 'b[all]et'),
('sting', '/stɪŋ/', 'v.叮', '(of an insect or plant) to touch your skin or make a very small hole in it so that you feel a sharp pain', 'A bee stung me on the arm and it really hurt!', '一只蜜蜂叮了我的胳膊一下，真疼！', '', 'st[ing]'),
('trickle', '/ˈtrɪkl/', 'v.一滴滴地流', 'to flow', 'The water trickles down from the tap.', '水从龙头里一滴滴地流出来。', '', 'tri[ck]-le'),
('irrespective', '/ˌɪrɪˈspektɪv/', 'adj.不考虑的，不顾的', 'without considering something or being influenced by it', '"Bookstores should be open to everyone', '书店应该对每个人开放，不管他们是富裕还是贫穷。', 'ir不 + re相反 + spect看 + ive……的 → 不回头看的 → irrespective不考虑的，不顾及的', '[ir]re-spec-tive'),
('depth', '/depθ/', 'n.深度', 'the distance from the top or surface to the bottom of something', 'There are many fishes at the depth of 150 meters.', '海洋150米深处有许多鱼。', 'dep深的 + th名词后缀 → depth深度', 'dep[th]'),
('tenant', '/ˈtenənt/', 'n.承租人，租客，佃户', 'a person who pays rent for the use of a room', 'We showed the new tenants around the apartment.', '我们带新租客去看了房。', 'ten握住 + ant人 → 拿钱租房之人 → tenant佃户；房客', 't[en]-ant'),
('proof', '/pruːf/', 'n.证据，证明', 'information', 'We have proof that you''re sick.', '我们有证据表明你生病了。', '', 'pr[oo]f'),
('universe', '/ˈjuːnɪvɜːrs/ ', 'n.宇宙，天地万物', 'the whole of space and everything in it', 'There are a lot of stars in the universe.', '宇宙中有很多星星。', 'uni一个 + vers转向 + e → 统一旋转 → universe宇宙', 'u-ni-v[er]se'),
('multiple', '/ˈmʌltɪpl/', 'adj.许多的；多种多样的', 'many in number; involving many different people or things', 'She had multiple outfits for this fashion magazine cover shoot.', '这次时尚杂志封面拍摄她拍了很多套造型。', 'multi很多 + ple满 → 多的 → multiple多功能的，多样的', 'mul-ti-[ple]'),
('predict', '/prɪˈdɪkt/', 'v.预言，预告，预测', 'to say that something will happen in the future', 'He predicted this stock would experience an increase in a few days.', '他预测该股票过几天会涨。', 'pre…前的，预先 + dict说 → 预先说 → 预言', 'pre-d[i]ct'),
('copper', '/ˈkɑːpər/', 'n.铜', 'brown coins that do not have much value', 'Chinese ancient coins were made of copper.', '中国古代钱币是铜做的。', '', 'copp[er]'),
('liver', '/ˈlɪvər/', 'n.肝脏', 'a large organ in the body that cleans the blood and produces bile', 'The largest internal organ in a human body is the liver.', '人体最大的内脏是肝脏。', '', 'liv-[er]'),
('probability', '/ˌprɑːbəˈbɪləti/', 'n.可能性；几率，概率', 'how likely something is to happen; (mathematics) a ratio showing the chances that a particular thing will happen', 'Look at the clouds! There''s a great probability of raining.', '看看这乌云！下雨的几率很大啊。', 'prob测试，证明 + ability名词后缀，表可...性 → 能被证明的 → probability可能性', 'pro-b[a]-b[i]-li-ty'),
('upward', '/ˈʌpwərd/', 'adj.向上的', 'towards a higher place or position', 'This chart shows an upward trend of the housing price.', '这张表显示了房价的上升趋势。', 'up向上 + ward向... → upward向上的', 'up-w[ar]d'),
('vent', '/vent/', 'n.通风口，排气口；（上衣背部或两侧的）开衩；  v.发泄（情绪）；泄露', 'an opening that allows air', 'The vent takes old air out and pushes fresh air in.', '通风孔将废气排出去，新鲜的空气送进来。', '', 'v[en]t'),
('appetite', '/ˈæpɪtaɪt/', 'n.食欲', 'physical desire for food', 'His appetite was greatly stimulated by these spicy chicken feet.', '这些辣鸡爪让他食欲大开。', 'ap加强动作 + pet追寻，寻求 + ite表名词 → 一再追求 → appetite胃口，欲望', '[a]ppetite'),
('herb', '"/ɜːrb/', 'n.草本植物', 'a plant or a part of a plant that is used as medicine or to give flavor to food ', '"Herbs can be used', '在烹饪的时候，草本植物可以用来为菜增味。', '', 'H[er]b'),
('wicked', '/ˈwɪkɪd/ ', 'adj.邪恶的，恶毒的', 'morally bad', 'The wicked witch possesses powerful magic.', '这位邪恶的女巫有着强大法力。', '', 'wi[ck]ed'),
('mint', '/mɪnt/', 'v.铸造（硬币）', 'a plant with dark green leaves that have a fresh smell and taste and are added to food and drinks to give flavour', 'Gold is being minted into coins.', '黄金正在被铸造成硬币。', '', 'm[in]t'),
