('nowadays', '/ˈnaʊədeɪz/', 'adv.现在，当今', 'at the present time', '"Nowadays', '如今，智能手机比这种旧手机先进多了。', 'nowaday现在 + s表副词 → 现今，当今', 'nowa-d[ay]s'),
('liberty', '/ˈlɪbərti/', 'n.自由', 'freedom to live as you choose without too many restrictions from government or authority; the state of not being a prisoner or a slave; the legal right and freedom to do something', 'The bird flew from the cage and got liberty.', '这只鸟飞出了鸟笼，得到了自由。', 'liber自由的 + ty表名词 → liberty自由', 'lib-[er]-ty'),
('yearly', '/ˈjɪrli/', 'adj.每年的，一年一度的', 'happening once a year or every year; paid', '"The yearly rental of the house is 2', '这房子的年租金是2350美元。', 'year年 + ly表副词，每……地 → yearly每年地', 'y[ear]-ly'),
('character', '/ˈkærəktər/', 'n.角色；品质', 'a person or an animal in a book', 'He dressed up as a character from a classic fairy tale.', '他打扮成了经典童话故事中的角色。', '', 'ch[ar]-ac-ter'),
('positive', '/ˈpɑːzətɪv/', 'adj.积极的，乐观的；确信的；阳性的；正面的；  n.正数；正极；正片；优势，优点', 'thinking about what is good in a situation: feeling confident and sure that something good will happen; completely sure that something is correct or true; directed at dealing with something or producing a successful result; showing clear evidence that a particular substance or medical condition is present', 'He faces every situation with a positive attitude.', '不管面对什么情形，他的心态都很积极。', 'posit肯定 + ive形容词后缀 → positive肯定的；积极的', 'po-s[i]-tive'),
('universal', '/ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːrsl/', 'adj.普遍的，全体的；广泛适用的', 'existent or operative everywhere or under all conditions; done by or involving all the people in the world or in a particular group; of worldwide scope or applicability', 'Electronic devices such as cellphones are universal now.', '如今像手机这样的电子设备已经得到了普及。', 'uni一个 + vers=versus转变 + al具有...性质的 → 变成一个的 → universal普遍的，全体的', 'u-ni-v[er]-s[al]'),
('helmet', '/ˈhelmɪt/', 'n.头盔；盔形物；  v.给……戴头盔', 'a type of hard hat that protects the head', 'He is wearing an orange helmet.', '他正戴着一顶橘色头盔。', 'helm头盔 + et小词后缀 → helmet保护，头盔', 'h[el]-met'),
('typhoon', '/taɪˈfuːn/', 'n.台风，强热带风暴', 'an extremely large', 'The trees and houses were blown away by the powerful typhoon.', '树木和房子都被强劲的台风吹走了。', '', 'ty-ph[oo]n'),
('regret', '/rɪˈɡret/', 'v.对……感到后悔，对...感到遗憾；抱歉；惋惜；  n.歉意；遗憾', 'a feeling of sadness or disappointment that you have because of something that has happened or something that you have done or not done', 'He regretted sending the message.', '他后悔发送了那条信息。', 're表强调 + gret哭泣，流泪 → regret后悔', 'r[e]-gret'),
('garage', '/ɡəˈrɑːʒ/', 'n.车库；修车厂', 'a place where vehicles are repaired and where you can buy a car or buy petrol/gas and oil', 'There is a car parked in the garage.', '有一辆车停在车库里。', 'gar掩盖，保护 + age名词后缀 → 遮挡和维修的地方 → garage车库，维修厂', 'gara[ge]'),
('grab', '/ɡræb/', 'v.抓住，抓取；  n.抓取', 'to take or hold somebody/something with your hand suddenly', 'Babies love to grab your fingers.', '婴儿喜欢抓住你的手指。', '', 'gr[a]b'),
('advantage', '/ədˈvæntɪdʒ/', 'n.优势', 'a thing that helps you to be better or more successful than other people', 'The man with the rocket gets a huge advantage.', '坐着火箭的人占了很大的优势。', '', 'ad-van-ta[ge]'),
('saint', '/seɪnt/', 'n.圣人', '(abbreviation S', 'Saints are often depicted with a circle of light above them to show their holiness.', '圣人头上常常被画上光环来显示其神圣。', '', 's[ai]nt'),
('decent', '/ˈdiːsnt/', 'adj.体面的，得体的；正派的', 'of a good enough standard or quality', 'The gentleman in the decent suit displayed great charm.', '这位绅士衣着得体，魅力十足。', 'dec合适的 + ent形容词后缀 → decent得体的', 'de-c[en]t'),
('fore', '/fɔːr/', 'n.前部，船头；  adj.在前部的；  adv.向前面，在前面，在船头；  prep.在前', 'in or into a place of importance', 'Their manager stood at the fore while the team stood closely behind.', '经理站在最前面，其余员工紧接在身后。', '', 'f[ore]'),
('phenomenon', '/fəˈnɑːmɪnən/', 'n.现象；奇迹；奇才', 'a fact or an event in nature or society', 'The Northern Lights are a wonderful natural phenomenon.', '北极光是一种奇妙的自然现象。', 'phen显示 + omen预兆 + on表示抽象名词 → 显示预兆 → phenomenon现象', '[ph]e-no-m[e]-non'),
('talent', '/ˈtælənt/  ', 'n.天赋，才能；天才，人才', 'a special ability that allows someone to do something well;  people or a person with a natural ability to do something well', 'This baby showed great talent as he was playing the piano.', '这个宝宝弹钢琴的时候展现出超强的天赋。', '', 't[al]-ent'),
('stool', '/stuːl/', 'n.凳子；老根株；  v.发新枝', '(often in compounds) a seat with legs but with nothing to support your back or arms', 'I bought some stools for my apartment in case guests come over and might need to sit on them.', '我在公寓里买了些凳子，以便有时会有客人来拜访。', '', 'sto[ol]'),
('class', '/klæs/', 'n.阶级，社会等级，等级制度；课，上课', 'a group of people within society who have the same economic and social position', 'People are divided into different social classes.', '人们被分为不同的社会阶层。', '', 'cl[a]ss'),
('stereotype', '/ˈsteriətaɪp/', 'n.老套的模式，陈规；  v.对……产生成见', 'a fixed idea or image that many people have of a particular type of person or thing', 'There are three typical stereotypes of South Korean TV shows.', '韩剧有三种经典的套路。', 'stereo立体 + type模式 → stereotype陈规，老套', 'st[ere]o-type'),
('ruin', '/ˈruːɪn/', 'v.毁灭，毁坏；  n.废墟', 'to damage (something) so badly that it is no longer useful', 'Our village was totally ruined by the UFO lasers.', '不明飞行物用射线完全摧毁了我们的村庄。', '', 'ru-[in]'),
('broad', '/brɔːd/', 'adj.广泛的；宽阔的', 'wide', 'He has a broad range of hobbies.', '他的爱好很广泛。', '', 'br[oa]d'),
('guard', '/ɡɑːrd/', 'n.卫兵，警卫员', 'a person', 'The guard stood outside and defended the palace gates.', '卫兵站在外面看守宫殿的大门。', '', 'g[ua]rd'),
('kidnap', '/ˈkɪdnæp/', 'v.绑架；诱拐；劫持', 'to take somebody away illegally and keep them as a prisoner', 'The sheep was kidnapped by a wolf.', '狼绑架了羊。', 'kid小孩 + nap=nab抓走 → 把小孩抓走 → kidnap绑架，诱拐', 'k[i]d-nap'),
('court', '/kɔːrt/', 'n.法院，法庭；球场；  v.招致灾祸', 'a judicial tribunal duly constituted for the hearing and determination of cases', 'There is nobody in the court room.', '法庭上没有人。', 'com一起 + hort庭院 → 一起聚集在庭院中 → court法院；法庭', 'c[our]t'),
('bolster', '/ˈboʊlstər/', 'v.支持，鼓励；  v.改善，加强', 'to improve something or make it stronger', 'The trainer gave words of encouragement to bolster the little boy''s confidence.', '教练说了一些鼓励的话来增加这个小男孩的信心。', '', 'b[ol]-ster'),
('dusk', '/dʌsk/', 'n.黄昏，傍晚', 'the time of day when the light has almost gone', 'I enjoy watching the sunset at dusk.', '我很享受在黄昏时看日落。', '', 'd[u]sk'),
('stalk', '/stɔːk/', 'n.茎，梗；  v.隐伏跟踪', 'to illegally follow and watch somebody over a long period of time', 'This plant has a strong stalk.', '这株植物有一根坚固的茎。', '', 'st[alk]'),
('clergy', '/ˈklɜːrdʒi/', 'n.牧师，神职人员', 'the priests or ministers of a religion', 'A member of the clergy is crossing his fingers to pray.', '一位牧师正在交叉手指祈祷。', '', '[cle]r-gy'),
('verse', '/vɜːrs/', 'n.诗句，诗节，诗', 'writing that is arranged in lines', 'I read a verse which describes some geese swimming in the water.', '我读了一节诗，诗里描写了一群在水中游动的鹅。', '', 'v[er]se'),
('marvelous', '/ˈmɑːrvələs/', 'adj.叹为观止的，令人惊奇的；非凡的', 'extremely good; wonderful', '"It is the most marvelous fireworks show!" the girl exclaimed.', '“这是最叹为观止的烟花表演！”这个女孩惊叹道。', 'marvel奇迹 + ous……的 → marvelous奇迹般的；了不起的', 'mar-v[el]ous');
INSERT INTO `graduate_word` (`word`, `phonetic`, `translate`, `definition_en`, `example_en`, `example_cn`, `mnemonic`, `cloze`) VALUES
('permanent', '/ˈpɜːrmənənt/', 'adj.永久的，永恒的', 'lasting for a long time or for all time in the future; existing all the time', '"The love between them was permanent', '他们之间的爱情是永久的，经得起时间的考验。', 'per贯穿，自始至终 + man留住 + ent形容词后缀 → 永久留住 → permanent永恒的', 'p[er]-ma-nent'),
('mobilize', '/ˈmoʊbəlaɪz/', 'v.鼓动起', 'to work together in order to achieve a particular aim; to organize a group of people to do this', 'The team mobilizes before the game starts', '在比赛开始前，球队在鼓劲加油。', 'mob动 + ilize使… → 使[人]动 → 动员[入伍]', 'mo-b[i]-lize'),
('despise', '/dɪˈspaɪz/', 'v.轻视，蔑视，看不起', '(not used in the progressive tenses) to dislike and have no respect for somebody/something', 'They despise cheating in games.', '他们鄙视在游戏中作弊。', 'de减低 + spise看→ despise鄙视', 'd[e]-spise'),
('adjective', '/ˈædʒɪktɪv/', 'n.【语法学】形容词', 'a word that describes a person or thing', 'We use adjectives to describe things.', '我们用形容词来描述物体。', 'ad向，朝 + ject扔 + ive形容词后缀 → 扔上去的，附加上去的 → adjective形容词', 'ad-j[e]c-tive'),
('roundabout', '/ˈraʊndəbaʊt/', 'adj.转弯抹角的；绕远道的；迂回的', 'not done or said using the shortest', 'He talks in a roundabout way.', '他说话拐弯抹角。', '"round圆的 + about大概，有关 → 迂回的', 'r[ou]nd-about'),
('wink', '/wɪŋk/', 'v.眨眼示意', 'to close one eye and open it again quickly', 'He winked at us to show what he had said was a joke.', '他朝我们眨眼，示意他刚说的是个玩笑。', '', 'wi[nk]'),
('puff', '/pʌf/', 'v.喷出；膨胀，肿胀；吹捧；一口口抽烟；  n.喷出；粉扑；呼吸；一口（气味，烟雾）；一阵，一股', 'to smoke a cigarette', 'His car puffed out smoke as it finally broke down.', '他的车喷出一股烟雾来表明它终于出故障了。', '', 'p[u]ff'),
('snobbish', '/ˈsnɑːbɪʃ/', 'adj.势利的，自命不凡的', 'thinking that having a high social class is very important; feeling that you are better than other people because you are more intelligent or like things that many people do not like', 'He''s a snobbish man because he only makes friends with rich people.', '他真是个势利眼，因为他只和有钱人交朋友。', 'snobb=snob势利眼 + ish表形容词，“像…一样，有的…” → 势利眼的', 'snobbi[sh]'),
('negative', '/ˈneɡətɪv/', 'adj.消极的，负面的', 'bad or harmful; considering only the bad side of something/somebody; lacking enthusiasm or hope', 'He received too many negative comments from others.', '他收到了太多负面的评价。', 'negat否认 + ive形容词后缀 → 否认的', 'ne-g[a]-tive'),
('apologise', '/əˈpɑːlədʒaɪz/', 'v.道歉，认错（=apologize）', 'to say that you are sorry for doing something wrong or causing a problem', 'I should apologise to my friend for what I did.', '我应该为我的所作所为向我朋友道歉。', 'apo离开 + log演说 + ise → 表动词退后一步说 → apologise道歉', 'apo-l[o]-gise'),
('skim', '/skɪm/', 'v.掠过，滑过', 'to move quickly or lightly along', 'The sea bird skims the water''s surface for a fish.', '海鸟在捕鱼时轻轻掠过水面。', '', 's[k]im'),
('tone', '/toʊn/', 'n.语气', 'the quality of somebody’s voice', 'The little boy learned to use a more polite tone when speaking to his mother.', '这个小男孩学会用更礼貌的语气和母亲说话。', '', 't[on]e'),
('fixture', '/ˈfɪkstʃər/', 'n.固定装置', 'a thing such as a bath/ bathtub or a toilet that is fixed in a house and that you do not take with you when you move house', 'The light fixture is being installed.', '电灯组件被装上了。', 'fix固定 + ture表名词 → 固定物，修理', 'fix-t[ure]'),
('forge', '/fɔːrdʒ/ ', 'n.熔炉；锻工车间；铁匠店；  v.锻造；经锻炼而形成；伪造', 'a large piece of equipment used for heating metals in; a building or part of a factory where this is found; a place where objects are made by heating and shaping pieces of metal', 'He tried to melt the metal by putting it into a forge.', '他试图把金属放进熔炉里来融化它。', '', 'for[ge]'),
('gymnasium', '/dʒɪmˈneɪziəm/', 'n.体育馆，健身房', 'a room or hall with equipment for doing physical exercise', 'The most popular facility in that gymnasium is the treadmill.', '跑步机是那家健身房里最受欢迎的器材。', 'gymn裸体的 + asium脱衣服锻炼的地方 → gymnasium体育馆', 'gym-n[a]-s[i]-um'),
('haste', '/heɪst/', 'n.匆忙；草率；  v.赶快', 'speed in doing something', 'They have to make haste to catch the flight.', '他们必须赶快才能坐上飞机。', '', 'h[a]ste'),
('meditation', '/ˌmedɪˈteɪʃn/ ', 'n.沉思，冥想', 'the practice of thinking deeply in silence', 'Meditation sessions help him to relax and escape from the stress of work.', '他借助冥想课来放松，逃离工作压力。', 'medit思考 + ation表名词 → meditation沉思，冥想', 'me-di-t[a]-t[ion]'),
('social', '/ˈsoʊʃl/ ', 'adj.交际的；社会性的；  n.社交聚会；联谊会，联欢会', 'relating to activities that involve meeting and communicating with other people', 'People chat and post things on social media platforms. ', '人们在社交媒体上聊天和发照片。', 'soc社会 + ial形容词后缀 → 社会的', 'so-c[ial]'),
('ground', '/ɡraʊnd/', 'n.理由，根据', 'a reason', '"What''s your ground for being late this time?"', '“你这次迟到的理由是什么？”', '', 'gr[ou]nd'),
('countryside', '/ˈkʌntrisaɪd/', 'n. 乡村，郊野', 'land outside towns and cities', 'This lovely house is in the countryside.', '这栋漂亮的房子在乡下。', 'country农村 + side边 → countryside乡下，农村', 'c[ou]n-try-side'),
('ceiling', '/ˈsiːlɪŋ/', 'n. 天花板', 'the inside surface at the top of a room', 'Look at my bright pink ceiling! It''s so girly!', '看我亮粉色的天花板！多么少女！', 'ceil装天花板 + ing名词后缀 → ceiling 天花板', 'ceil-[ing]'),
('type', '/taɪp/', 'v.打字；  n.类型，种类', 'a class or group of people or things that share particular qualities or features and are part of a larger group; a kind or sort', '"I never learned to type very quickly', '我从没学过快速打字，所以写这封电子邮件花了我很长时间。', '', 'typ[e]'),
('government', '/ˈɡʌvərnmənt/ ', 'n.政府', 'a particular system used for controlling a country', 'The offices of the local government are in this building.', '当地政府的办公室就在这栋楼里。', 'govern统治 + ment表名词 → 政府', 'gov-[er]n-ment'),
('leaf', '/liːf/', 'n.叶', 'one of the flat and typically green parts of a plant that grow from a stem or twig', 'Adding mint leaves to some foods or drinks can taste refreshing.', '在一些食物或饮料中添加薄荷叶尝起来会很清凉。', '', '[le]af'),
('side', '/saɪd/', 'n.边', 'either of the two halves of a surface', 'There are many trees on both sides of the river.', '小河两边的岸上有许多树。', '', 'sid[e]'),
('price', '/praɪs/', 'n.代价', 'the unpleasant things that you must do or experience in order to achieve something or as a result of achieving something', 'The price of watching this movie is missing an important interview.', '观看这场电影的代价是错过一场重要的面试。', '', 'Pric[e]'),
('save', '/seɪv/', 'prep.除...外', '(also save for) (old use or formal) except sth', 'The room was empty save for a single chair.', '房间除了一把椅子外，空无一物。', '', 's[a]ve'),
('hard', '/hɑːrd/', 'adj.用力的，耗费很多体力的；困难的', 'needing or using a lot of physical or mental effort', 'Carrying logs all day was hard work.', '整天搬运木头是很耗费体力的工作。', '', 'h[ar]d'),
('wherever', '/werˈevər/', 'conj.无论在哪里', 'in any place; in all places that; in all cases that', '"Wherever you want your package to go', '无论你想让你的包裹去哪儿，我们都能送达。', '', 'wh[er]-ev-er'),
('certain', '/ˈsɜːrtn/', 'adj.有把握的；肯定的，必然的', 'that you can rely on to happen or to be true', 'The girl is certain about her answer.', '这个女孩确信自己的答案。', 'cert确实 + ain形容词后缀 → certain确实的，一定的', 'c[er]-tain'),
('cough', '/kɔːf/', 'v.咳嗽；  n.咳嗽', 'to force out air suddenly and noisily through your throat', 'He coughed badly when he was ill.', '他生病时咳嗽得厉害。', '', 'c[ough]'),
('trust', '/trʌst/', 'n.信托；  v.信任，相信', 'a legal arrangement in which a person or organization controls property and/or money for another person or organization', 'They ask the trust to manage their money.', '他们请信托来管理他们的钱。', 'tru坚固，坚定 + st表名词  → （坚定地）相信  → trust信任', 'tr[u]st'),
('bathroom', '/ˈbæθruːm/', 'n.浴室，盥洗室', 'a room with a sink and toilet and usually a bathtub or shower', '"This bathroom contains a washbasin', '这个浴室有一个洗脸盆，一个马桶和一个淋浴器。', 'bath洗澡 + room房间 → bathroom 浴室', 'ba[th]-room'),
('pronunciation', '/prəˌnʌnsiˈeɪʃn/', 'n.发音', 'the way in which a language or a particular word or sound is pronounced', 'Learning the pronunciation of words is very important.', '学习单词的发音是很重要的。', 'pro在前 + nunci讲话，说出 + ation名词后缀 → pronunciation发音', 'pro-n[un]-ci-a-t[ion]'),
('merry', '/ˈmeri/', 'adj.欢乐的，愉快的', 'slightly drunk', 'I wish you a merry Christmas!', '祝你圣诞快乐！', '', 'm[er]ry'),
('situation', '/ˌsɪtʃuˈeɪʃn/', 'n.形势，局面；位置，场所；职位，职务', 'all the circumstances and things that are happening at a particular time and in a particular place', 'The general is analyzing the current situation of the war.', '将军正在分析当前战争的形势。', 'situat位于 + ion名词后缀 → situation地理位置', 'si-tu-[a]-t[ion]'),
('found', '/faʊnd/', 'v.成立，建立，创办', '', 'These two businessmen founded a new company together.', '这两个商人一起创办了一家新公司。', '', 'f[ou]nd'),
('basket', '/ˈbæskɪt/', 'n.篮，篓，筐', 'a container for holding or carrying things. Baskets are made of thin strips of material that bends and twists easily', 'I always use this basket to pack food for a picnic.', '我经常用这个篮子来装野餐的食物。', '', 'b[a]s-ket'),
('daughter', '/ˈdɔːtər/', 'n.女儿', 'a person’s female child', 'She reads to her daughter.', '她给她的女儿读书。', '', 'daugh-t[er]'),
('western', '/ˈwestərn/', 'adj.有西方特征的', 'located in the west or facing west; connected with the west part of the world', 'I decided to wear a western style wedding dress.', '我决定穿西式婚礼裙。', 'west西方 + ern……方向的 → western西方的', 'west-[er]n'),
('very', '/ˈveri/', 'adj.恰好的；  adv.很，非常', '(used to add emphasis to a noun) exact or particular', 'His mom was back home at this very moment.', '恰好这个时候他妈妈回来了。', '', 'v[er]y'),
('artefact', '/ˈɑːrtɪfækt/', 'n.人工制品，加工品', '', 'This old artefact was made by a craftsman thousands of years ago.', '这个古老的人工制品是数千年前的手工艺人制作的。', 'arte=arti利用技巧 + fact做的东西 → artefact人工制品', '[ar]te-fact'),
('precision', '/prɪˈsɪʒn/', 'n.精确', 'the quality of being exact', 'This is a tool with precision for measurements.', '这个仪器用于精密测量。', 'pre预先 + cis切 + ion表名词 → 预先切好 → 精密，正确', 'pre-ci-s[ion]'),
('quarantine', '/ˈkwɔːrəntiːn/', 'v.隔离', 'to keep (a person or animal) away from others to prevent a disease from spreading :to put or keep (a person or animal) in quarantine', 'The zombies have been quarantined in order to keep people safe.', '丧尸已经被隔离以确保人类的安全。', 'quarant检疫 + ine表示抽象名词 → quarantine隔离检查', 'qu[ar]-an-tine'),
('shorthand', '/ˈʃɔːrthænd/', 'n.速记', 'a quick way of writing using special signs or abbreviations', 'She is taking down the speech in shorthand.', '她正在用速记记录演讲内容。', '', '[sh]ort-hand'),
('slam', '/slæm/', 'v.砰地关上；砰地放下；  n.砰的一声', 'to shut', 'He slams the door as he leaves.', '他走的时候，砰的一声把门关上了。', '', 'sl[a]m'),
('bid', '/bɪd/', 'n.出价；努力争取', 'an offer to pay a particular amount of money for something', 'The winning bid in the auction was $5.', '拍卖的中标价是5美元。', '', 'b[i]d'),
('refusal', '/rɪˈfjuːzl/', 'n.拒绝', 'an act of saying or showing that you will not do', 'The boy crossed his arms and persisted in his refusal to eat.', '男孩双臂交叉，坚持拒绝吃饭。', 're向后，相反 + fus流，泻 + al名词后缀 → 流向相反 → 拒绝', 're-fus[al]'),
('appendix', '/əˈpendɪks/', 'n.阑尾', 'a small bag of tissue that is attached to the large intestine. In humans', 'He has an acute pain in his appendix area.', '他的阑尾区域疼痛得厉害。', '', 'app[en]-dix'),
('tide', '/taɪd/ ', 'n.潮汐', 'the regular upward and downward movement of the level of the ocean that is caused by the pull of the Sun and the Moon on the Earth', '"The tide is going out', '潮水退去了，海滩变得柔软又干净。', '', 'tid[e]'),
('chaos', '/ˈkeɪɑːs/', 'n.混乱，纷乱', 'a state of complete confusion and lack of order', 'The performance stage was in chaos due to an unexpected glitch.', '由于突发故障，表演舞台一片混乱。', '', 'ch[ao]s'),
('colonial', '/kəˈloʊniəl/', 'adj.殖民地的，关于殖民的；  n.殖民地居民', 'connected with or belonging to a country that controls another country; typical of or connected with the US at the time when it was still a British colony', '"In colonial times', '殖民地时代，欧洲人入侵了许多国家。', 'colon殖民地 + ial具有……的 → 殖民地的，具有殖民地特点的', 'colo-n[ial]'),
('ritual', '/ˈrɪtʃuəl/', 'n.（宗教等的）仪式，例行公事；  adj.作为仪式一部分的，例行的', 'a series of actions that are always performed in the same way', '"In some cultures', '在一些文化中，人们有出生洗礼的仪式。', 'rit=rite仪式 + ual表形容词 → ritual仪式的', 'ri-tu-[al]'),
('insight', '/ˈɪnsaɪt/', 'n.深刻的理解，洞察力', 'the ability to see and understand the truth about people or situations; an understanding of what something is like', 'He really has an insight into math.', '他对数学真的有很深刻的见解。', 'in进入 + sight眼光 → 眼光看进去 → 洞察力', 'in-s[igh]t'),
('exceed', '/ɪkˈsiːd/', 'v.超过；胜过；超出', 'to do more than the law or an order', 'The temperature is expected to exceed 90 degrees Fahrenheit today.', '今天的气温预计会超过90华氏度。', 'ex向外 + ceed去；让步 → exceed超出', 'ex-c[ee]d'),
('strengthen', '/ˈstreŋθn/', 'v.增强', 'to become stronger; to make somebody/something stronger', 'She keeps training every day to strengthen her arms.', '她每天坚持锻炼来使手臂变强壮。', 'strength力量 + en动词后缀  → strengthen加强', 'streng[th]-en'),
('warehouse', '/ˈwerhaʊs/', 'n.仓库', 'a building where large quantities of goods are stored', 'The warehouse is full of boxes.', '仓库里堆满了货箱。', 'ware物件 + house房子 → 放货物的房子 → warehouse仓库', 'w[are]-house'),
('barrel', '/ˈbærəl/', 'n.桶；枪管', 'a large round container', 'These barrels are used to store beer.', '这些木桶都用来储存啤酒。', '', 'barr[el]'),
('drastic', '/ˈdræstɪk/', 'adj.极端的；猛烈的；激烈的', 'extreme in a way that has a sudden', 'They have experienced drastic weather changes in one day.', '他们在一天之内经历了极端的天气变化。', 'dra表演 + stic=istic有……性质的 → 表演十分投入的 → 充满激情的 → drastic激烈的', 'dr[a]s-tic'),
('furious', '/ˈfjʊriəs/ ', 'adj.愤怒的；狂怒的；猛烈的', 'very angry', 'I''m so angry—I''m absolutely furious with you!', '我真的很生气——我对你感到非常愤怒!', 'fury ( y → i ）暴怒，狂暴＋- ous 形容词词尾 → furious狂怒的，激烈的', 'fu-ri-[ou]s'),
('delicate', '/ˈdelɪkət/', 'adj.易碎的，脆弱的；（人）娇弱的，体弱多病的；精美的，精致的；微妙的，需要谨慎处理的；优美的，优雅的；淡雅的', 'easily broken or damaged', 'The vase is delicate and should be packed with care.', '花瓶易碎，应小心打包。', 'de远离 + licate诱惑，吸引 → 易损坏但有吸引力的 → delicate精致的，易碎的', 'de-l[i]-cate'),
('remedy', '/ˈremədi/', 'v.治疗；恢复；补救；  n.治疗；补救；矫正', 'to relieve or cure (a disease', 'He took some pills to remedy his cough.', '他吃了一些药丸来治疗咳嗽。', 're再 + med救治 → 再次救治 → remedy治疗，补救', 're-m[e]-dy'),
('pathetic', '/pəˈθetɪk/', 'adj.可怜的；不足的', 'making you feel pity or sadness', 'My dog shows a pathetic look when begging for food.', '我的狗在讨吃的时候总是露出一副可怜的模样。', 'path感情，痛苦，病 + etic有……性质的 → 令人生厌的，可怜的，可悲的', 'pa-[th]et-ic'),
('insurance', '/ɪnˈʃʊrəns/', 'n.保险；保险费；保险业', 'an arrangement with a company in which you pay them regular amounts of money and they agree to pay the costs', 'A labour insurance can offer financial protection against loss as a result of an accident.', '劳动保险能够提供经济上的保护，赔偿因事故造成的损失。', 'insur保证 + ance名词后缀 → insurance保险', 'in-s[ur]-ance'),
('silver', '/ˈsɪlvər/', 'n.银，银子；  adj.银色的', 'a soft grayish-white metal that is very valuable and is used to make jewelry', 'Our wedding rings are made of silver.', '我们的婚戒是银制的。', '', 'sil-v[er]'),
('afterward', '/''ɑːftəwəd/', 'adv.之后，后来，以后', 'at a later time; after an event that has already been mentioned', '"Afterward', '随后，请清洁你家狗狗的便便。', 'after以后 + ward向...的 → afterward之后', 'af-t[er]-ward'),
('ward', '/wɔːrd/', 'n.病房', 'a separate room or area in a hospital for people with the same type of medical condition', 'There is no patient in the ward.', '现在病房里没有病人。', 'war=wer感知，注意 + d → 关注病情的地方 → ward病房', 'w[ar]d'),
('diamond', '/ˈdaɪəmənd/', 'n.钻石；方块牌；菱形；棒球场的内场', 'a shape with four straight sides of equal length and with angles that are not right angles', 'The diamond is shining brightly.', '这枚钻石闪闪发光。', 'diam=adam强硬的，不屈服的 + ond → 坚硬的石头 → 钻石', 'di-a-m[on]d'),
('forbid', '/fərˈbɪd/', 'v.禁止；妨碍', 'to order somebody not to do something; to order that something must not be done', 'We forbid smoking in the restaurant.', '餐厅内禁止吸烟。', 'for反对；相反 + bid要求 → forbid禁止', 'f[or]-bid'),
('ankle', '/ˈæŋkl/', 'n.踝，踝关节', 'the joint connecting the foot to the leg', 'An injured ankle should be wrapped in a bandage.', '受伤的脚踝应该用绷带包扎好。', '', 'an-[kle]'),
('indoor', '/ˈɪndɔːr/', 'adj. 室内的', 'located', 'Natural indoor lighting saves on energy costs.', '利用室内的自然光线可以减少能源消耗。', 'in向内，进入 + door门 → 门内的', 'in-d[oor]'),
('physician', '/fɪˈzɪʃn/', 'n.内科医生', 'a doctor', 'The attending physician told me to eat more fruits and vegetables.', '这位主治医生告诉我要多吃水果和蔬菜。', 'phys生理领域 + ician表专家，从事某职业的人 → physician内科医生', 'physi-c[ia]n'),
('cosmic', '/ˈkɑːzmɪk/', 'adj.宇宙的；广大无边的', 'connected with the whole universe', 'Stars and planets form part of the cosmic system.', '恒星和行星是宇宙系统的一部分。', 'cosm宇航 + ic……的 → 宇宙的', 'c[o]s-mic'),
('stagger', '/ˈstæɡər/', 'v.蹒跚；（使）错开（时间）；使吃惊；  n.蹒跚', 'to walk with weak unsteady steps', 'The old woman staggered toward the hospital.', '老妇人蹒跚地走向医院。', '', 'Stag[ge]r'),
('sow', '/soʊ/', 'v.播种；种；散布；  n.母猪（读作/saʊ/）', 'to plant or spread seeds in or on the ground', 'He is sowing seeds into the soil.', '他正在往土里播种。', '', 's[ow]'),
('motivate', '/ˈmoʊtɪveɪt/', 'v.激励；促进', 'to make somebody want to do something', 'Praise from a teacher can always motivate students to seek more knowledge.', '来自老师的夸赞经常能激励学生学习更多的知识。', 'motiv运动的 + ate表动词 → motivate促动；激励，激发', 'mo-t[i]-vate'),
('release', '/rɪˈliːs/', 'v.释放；发布，发行；  n.发布', 'to let somebody/something come out of a place where they have been kept or trapped; to stop holding something or stop it from being held so that it can move', 'The prisoner was released after his sentence was complete.', '这个囚犯服完刑后被释放了。', 're向后 + lease松开 → 释放，发布', 're-l[ea]se'),
('request', '/rɪˈkwest/', 'n.（正式或礼貌的）请求；要求；  v.请求，要求；要求，请求', 'an act of politely or formally asking for something', 'His father agreed to his request for a Superman costume.', '他父亲同意了他想要一套超人服装的请求。', 're再 + quest寻求，询问 → 再寻求 → request要求', 're-[que]st'),
('delivery', '/dɪˈlɪvəri/', 'n.递送', 'the act of taking goods', 'The delivery service aims to deliver each package as quickly as possible.', '投递服务旨在尽快派送每个包裹。', 'de完全 + liver释放 + y形容词后缀 → 快递;投递;交付;分娩', 'de-liv-[er]y'),
('signal', '/ˈsɪɡnəl/', 'n.信号；标志；预兆；  v.标志；发信号；  adj.显著的，优越的；暗号的，作信号用的', 'a movement or sound that you make to give somebody information', 'The ship sent out a signal for help.', '这艘船发出了求救信号。', 'sign标志 + al名词/形容词后缀 → signal信号/显要的', 'sig-n[al]'),
('appreciate', '/əˈpriːʃieɪt/', 'v.感谢，感激；欣赏；领会', 'to recognize the good qualities of somebody/something', 'Grandma highly appreciated the gift on her birthday.', '外婆为她生日那天收到的礼物表示十分感谢。', 'ap一再 + preci价值 + ate动词后缀 → 一再给价 → appreciate欣赏', 'appre-c[i]-ate'),
('transition', '/trænˈzɪʃn/', 'n.转变', 'the process or a period of changing from one state or condition to another', 'Our body changes during the transition from youth to old age.', '我们的身体在从青年到老年的转变过程中会经历很多变化。', 'transit转变 + ion名词后缀 → transition转变', 'tran-si-t[ion]'),
('infant', '/ˈɪnfənt/', 'n.幼儿，婴儿；  adj.婴儿的', 'a baby or very young child', 'The infant in the duck towel is laughing happily.', '裹在鸭子毛巾里的小婴儿笑得真开心。', 'in不 + fant说话 →不能说话的 → infant婴儿的', '[in]-fant'),
('portfolio', '/pɔːrtˈfoʊlioʊ/', 'n.公文包，文件夹', 'a thin flat case used for carrying documents', 'He is checking his portfolio to find some documents.', '他正在找公文包里的文件。', 'port拿，运 + folio树叶，页 → 拿树叶[书页]的东西 → 文件夹；投资组合', 'p[or]t-fo-lio'),
('underneath', '/ˌʌndərˈniːθ/', 'prep.在……下面', 'under or below something else', 'We pass underneath the highway.', '我们从公路下面穿过。', 'under下 ＋ neath下面 → underneath在下面', 'un-der-nea[th]'),
('counsel', '/ˈkaʊnsl/', 'n.律师，法律顾问；忠告；  v.劝告，提议', 'a lawyer or group of lawyers representing somebody in court', 'The man speaking to the judges is the counsel for the defense.', '正在对法官说话的人是被告律师。', 'coun=con表强调 + sel带来，召集 → counsel忠告', 'coun-s[el]'),
('crawl', '/krɔːl/', 'v.爬', 'to move forward on your hands and knees', 'The baby crawls forward on his arms and legs.', '小婴儿手脚并用地爬行向前。', 'cra抓，刻 + wl → 用爪子抓着前进 → crawl爬行', 'cr[aw]l'),
('cattle', '/ˈkætl/', 'n.（总称）牛，牲口', 'cows and bulls that are kept as farm animals for their milk or meat', 'A herd of cattle is grazing in the field.', '一群牛正在草地上吃草！', '', 'cat[tle]'),
('multiple', '/ˈmʌltɪpl/', 'adj.许多的', 'many in number; involving many different people or things', 'We can see the multiple colors of the lipsticks on her arms.', '我们可以看到她手臂上多种多样的口红颜色。', 'multi很多 + ple满 → 多的 → multiple多功能的，多样的', 'mul-ti-[ple]'),
('fright', '/fraɪt/', 'n.恐怖，惊吓', 'a feeling of fear; an experience that makes you feel fear', 'The rabbit cried out in fright when it saw the wolf.', '兔子看到狼时吓尿了!', '', 'fr[igh]t'),
('warmth', '/wɔːrmθ/', 'n.温暖，暖和', 'the state or quality of being warm', 'A cup of hot coffee in the morning fills me with warmth.', '早晨的一杯热咖啡使我感到温暖。', 'warm温暖的 + th抽象名词 → warmth温暖', 'warm[th]'),
('liver', '/ˈlɪvər/', 'n.肝脏', 'a large organ in the body that cleans the blood and produces bile', 'The doctor said that this medicine can treat her liver cancer.', '医生说这个药可以治疗她的肝癌。', '', 'liv-[er]'),
('notable', '/ˈnoʊtəbl/', 'adj.值得注意的，显著的；  n.著名人士', 'deserving to be noticed or to receive attention; important', 'A blue lemon is particularly notable in the group.', '蓝色的柠檬在这里面非常显眼。', 'not=note痕迹，迹象 + able能…的 → 值得注意的', 'no-ta[ble]'),
('widow', '/ˈwɪdoʊ/', 'n.寡妇，遗孀', 'a woman whose husband has died and who has not married again', 'The poor woman became a widow after her husband''s death.', '那个可怜的女人在她丈夫死后就成了寡妇。', '', 'wid-[ow]'),
('participate', '/pɑːrˈtɪsɪˌpeɪt/', 'v.参与，参加', 'to take part in or become involved in an activity', 'The teacher is happy when her students participate in class discussions.', '当学生们参与课堂讨论时，老师很开心。', 'parti=part部分，分开 + cip抓住 + ate动词后缀 → 抓住机会成为其中一部分 → 参加', 'p[ar]-ti-c[i]-pate'),
('conceal', '/kənˈsiːl/', 'v.隐藏，隐瞒，掩盖', 'to hide somebody/something', 'I use this mask to conceal my emotion.', '我用面具来隐藏我的情绪。', 'con加强 + ceal隐藏 → conceal隐埋，掩盖', 'con-c[ea]l'),
('transparent', '/trænsˈpærənt/', 'adj.透明的，清澈的', '(of glass', 'These glasses are transparent.', '这些玻璃杯是透明的。', 'trans横过，超过 + par出现 + ent形容词后缀 → 横穿某物能看见 → transparent透明的', 'trans-p[ar]-ent'),
('swear', '/swer/', 'v.发誓，郑重地说，保证；咒骂', 'to make a serious promise to do something; to promise that you are telling the truth; to make a public or official promise', 'I swear I''m telling the truth.', '我发誓我讲的是实话。', '', 'sw[ear]'),
('warranty', '/ˈwɔrənti/', 'n.保修单', 'a written statement that promises the good condition of a product and states that the maker is responsible for repairing or replacing the product usually for a certain period of time after its purchase', '"The phone came with a one-year warranty', '这个手机有一年的保修期，所以他有权享受免费维修。', 'warrant保证 ＋ y表名词 → warranty（正当）理由', 'w[ar]ran-ty'),
('strap', '/stræp/ ', 'v.捆扎；  n.带子', 'to fasten somebody/something in place using a strap or straps; to wrap strips of material around a wound or an injured part of the body', 'Strap the safety belt before driving.', '开车前先为自己系上安全带。', '', 'str[a]p');
INSERT INTO `graduate_word` (`word`, `phonetic`, `translate`, `definition_en`, `example_en`, `example_cn`, `mnemonic`, `cloze`) VALUES
('humiliate', '/hjuˈmɪlieɪt/', 'v.羞辱；使蒙耻；使丢脸', 'to make somebody feel ashamed or stupid and lose the respect of other people', 'The poor boy was badly humiliated at school.', '那个可怜的男孩在学校遭受了严重的羞辱。', 'humili低的，在地上 + ate表动词 → 使人贴在地上 → humiliate羞辱；使蒙羞；使丢脸', 'hu-m[i]-l[i]-ate'),
('production', '/prəˈdʌkʃn/', 'n.生产', 'the process of growing or making food', 'Thousands of cars are under production in this factory.', '数以千计的汽车在这家工厂进行生产。', 'product生产 + ion名词后缀 → production生产', 'pro-duc-t[ion]'),
('ozone', '/ˈoʊzoʊn/', 'n.臭氧；能使人兴奋的力量', 'a poisonous gas with a strong smell that is a form of oxygen', 'The ozone layer provides protection between the Sun and the Earth.', '臭氧层在太阳和地球之间提供了保护。', '', 'o-z[on]e'),
('divine', '/dɪˈvaɪn/', 'adj.神的，神圣的；  v.（凭直觉）发现，猜到', 'coming from or connected with God or a god', '"With divine love and the blessing of god', '伴随着神圣的爱情和神的祝福，他们步入了婚姻的殿堂。', 'div=dyeu照耀，天神 + ine如...的 → 神的，神圣的', 'di-v[in]e'),
('semiconductor', '/ˌsemikənˈdʌktər/', 'n.半导体', 'a solid substance that conducts electricity in particular conditions', 'Semiconductor is an important material to make chips.', '半导体是做芯片的重要材料。', 'semi半 ＋ conduct传导＋ or名词后缀，表物 → semiconductor半导体', 'semi-c[on]-duc-t[or]'),
('failure', '/ˈfeɪljər/', 'n.失败者', 'a person or thing that is not successful', '"If I can\\u0027t increase sales', '如果不能增加销售额，我就是一个失败者！', 'fail犯错误，欺骗 + ure名词后缀 → 错误状态 → failure失败', 'fail-[ure]'),
('panorama', '/ˌpænəˈræmə/', 'n.全景，概观', 'a view of a wide area of land; a description', 'This panorama view shows the entire downtown skyline.', '这张全景显示了整个城市的天际线。', 'pan广泛的 + orama视力 → 广泛视力范围所及的 → panorama全景，全貌', 'pan[or]a-ma'),
('nasty', '/ˈnæsti/', 'adj.令人讨厌的', 'unkind; unpleasant', 'The shoe smells nasty.', '这鞋的味道令人讨厌。', 'nast脏的 + y表形容词 → nasty令人讨厌的', 'n[a]sty'),
('fool', '/fuːl/', 'n.笨蛋，傻瓜；  v.玩弄', 'a person who you think behaves or speaks in a way that lacks intelligence or good judgement', 'He is such a fool that he can''t answer this question.', '他连这个问题都答不出，真是个傻瓜。', '', 'fo[ol]'),
('worship', '/ˈwɜːrʃɪp/', 'v.崇拜，爱戴', 'to show respect for God or a god', '"In ancient times', '在古代，中国农民常常敬拜土地公公。', 'wor值得敬仰的 + ship表示条件、行动、地位、关系等 -> worship崇拜', 'wor-[sh]ip'),
('layout', '/ˈleɪˌaʊt/', 'n.布局；（版面）设计', 'the way in which the parts of something such as the page of a book', 'The picture shows the layout of the flat.', '这张图展示了这套公寓的布局。', 'lay放置 + out在外部 → layout布局，安排', 'l[ay]-out'),
