('dividend', '/ˈdɪvɪˌdɛnd/', 'n.（股份的）红利，回报，效益', 'an amount of the profits that a company pays to people who own shares in the company; a money prize that is given to winners in the football pools; a number which is to be divided by another number', 'The company paid dividends to its investors.', '公司给投资者分了红。', 'di分开 + vid分开 + end名词后缀 → 被分配的利益 → dividend红利，股息', 'di-vi-d[en]d'),
('envisage', '/ɪnˈvɪzɪdʒ/', 'v.想象，设想', 'to imagine what will happen in the future', 'He envisages a future where he owns a home.', '他设想一个拥有自己的家的未来。', 'en致使 + vis=see表示“看” + age名词后缀 → 使能在脑海中看见 → 想象，设想', 'en-vis-a[ge]'),
('cafe', '/kæˈfeɪ/', 'n.咖啡馆', 'a place where you can buy drinks and simple meals. Alcohol is not usually served in British or American cafes.; a small shop/store that sells sweets', 'The man drinks coffee in a cafe.', '这个男人在咖啡馆喝咖啡。', '', ''),
('execute', '/ˈeksɪkjuːt/', 'v.处决，处死；完成（动作）；实行；执行（计划）', 'to kill somebody or something', 'This pathetic bird is going to be executed by the cruel hunter.', '这只可怜的小鸟将要被残酷的猎人处决了。', 'ex向外 + (s)ec跟随，相接 + ute → 一步接一步的执行 → 实施，将……处死', 'e-x[e]-cute'),
('elbow', '/ˈelboʊ/', 'n.手肘；衣服肘部；  v.用肘推、挤', 'the joint between the upper and lower parts of the arm where it bends in the middle', 'My elbow hurts really bad!', '我的胳膊肘伤得很重！', '', 'el-b[ow]'),
('namely', '/ˈneɪmli/', 'adv.即，也就是', 'as follows', '"She took two classes this morning', '她今天上午上了两节课，即英语课和数学课。', 'name名字 + ly副词和形容词后缀 → 顾名思义，如名字所说 → namely即，也就是', ''),
('spin', '/spɪn/', 'v.（使）旋转；  n.纺织', 'to turn or cause someone or something to turn around repeatedly ', 'The top spins across the floor.', '陀螺在地板上旋转。', '', 'sp[in]'),
('segment', '"/seɡˈment/', 'n.部分', 'a part of something that is separate from the other parts or can be considered separately', '"Obviously', '很明显，这只是整个披萨的一部分。', 'seg切，割 + ment名词后缀 → 部分；切片', 'seg-m[en]t'),
('casualty', '/ˈkæʒuəlti/', 'n.伤亡人员，死伤者，受害人', 'a person who is killed or injured in war or in an accident', 'We suffered one casualty at work today.', '在今天的工作中，有一人不幸遇难。', 'casual待命士兵的 + ty表名词 → casualty（事故）伤亡人员', 'ca-s[u]-[al]-ty'),
('perplex', '/pərˈpleks/', 'v.使困惑', 'if something perplexes you', 'The problem perplexes the woman; she is very confused.', '这个问题很费解，她好困惑。', 'per贯穿，自始自终 + plex重叠 → 始终重叠 → 迷惑', 'per-[ple]x'),
('recite', '/rɪˈsaɪt/', 'v.背诵；朗诵，吟诵；列举；  v.背诵；朗诵', 'to repeat (a poem', 'The boy is reciting a poem to his teacher.', '男孩正在向老师背一首诗。', 're一再，重新 + cit唤起 + e → recite背诵；演奏', 'r[e]-cite'),
('cemetery', '/ˈseməteri/', 'n.墓地；公墓', 'an area of land used for burying dead people', 'Many tombstones lie in this cemetery.', '这片墓地里有许多墓碑。', 'ceme睡 + tery表地点 → （永远）睡觉的地方 → cemetery墓地', 'ceme-t[er]y'),
('collapse', '/kəˈlæps/', 'v.（突然）倒塌，昏倒；  n.倒塌；暴跌', 'a sudden failure of something', 'The building collapsed after the earthquake.', '地震后这栋建筑倒塌了。', 'col共同 + lapse倒 → 全部倒下 → collapse倒塌', 'c[oll]apse'),
('compact', '"/kəmˈpækt/', 'n.合约，条约', 'smaller than is usual for things of the same kind; using or filling only a small amount of space', 'They signed a peace compact.', '他们签订了和平条约。', 'com共同 + pact压紧 → 全部压紧 → compact紧密的', 'com-p[a]ct'),
('homogeneous', '/ˌhoʊməˈdʒiːniəs/', 'adj.同类的，同质的，有相同特征的', 'consisting of things or people that are all the same or all of the same type', 'The old town is ethnically homogeneous compared with the big city.', '与大城市相比，这个古镇的人口种族单一。', 'homo相同 + gene种类 + ous形容词后缀 → homogeneous同类的，相似特征的', 'ho-mo-[ge]-ne[ou]s'),
('claim', '/kleɪm/ ', 'n.索赔；声明；  v.声称；认领，要求（拥有）', 'a request for a sum of money that you believe you have a right to', 'I want to make an insurance claim for the damage of my car.', '我想为我的汽车遭受的损失提出保险索赔。', '', 'cl[ai]m'),
('reckon', '/ˈrekən/', 'v.估算；认为', 'to calculate an amount', '"The agent reckoned the house was worth about 500', '房屋中介估算这房子价值50万元。', '', 're[ck]-on'),
('prejudice', '/ˈpredʒədɪs/', 'n.偏见，成见', 'an unfair feeling of dislike for a person or group because of race', 'The other elephants held a prejudice against him because of his giant ears.', '其他大象因他的大耳朵而对其抱有偏见。', 'pre预先 + judice判断 → 预先判断 → 偏见', 'pre-j[u]-dice'),
('recover', '/rɪˈkʌvər/', 'v.恢复', 'to become healthy after an illness or injury; to return to normal health', 'He has recovered well from his foot injury.', '他的脚伤已经痊愈了。', 're重新 + cover盖住 → recover重新获得', 're-cov-[er]'),
('clause', '/klɔːz/', 'n.条款；从句', 'an item in a legal document that says that a particular thing must or must not be done', 'The tenant will sign the tenancy agreement after checking every clause.', '房客核对完每条条款后才会签署租房合同。', '', 'cl[au]se'),
('turkey', '/ˈtɜːrki/', 'n.火鸡，火鸡肉', 'large gallinaceous bird with fan-shaped tail; widely domesticated for food', 'The man is holding a big roast turkey.', '这个男人手里拿着一只大的烤火鸡。', '', ''),
('previous', '/ˈpriːviəs/', 'adj.先前的；早先的；过早的', 'happening or existing before the event or object that you are talking about', 'He offered a concise overview of his previous style.', '他简要概述了自己以前的风格。', 'pre以前 + vi路[引申为走] + ous……的 → 以前走过的 → previous先的，前的', 'pre-vi-[ou]s'),
('profession', '/prəˈfeʃn/', 'n.职业；行业；声明', 'a type of job that needs special training or skill', 'The four people have different professions.', '这四个人有着不同的职业。', 'pro在前面 + fess说 + ion表名词 → 在前面说话 → profession职业', 'pro-fess[io]n'),
('employment', '/ɪmˈplɔɪmənt/', 'n.职业；雇用；就业', 'work', 'She found employment as an English teacher.', '她找到了一份英语老师的工作。', 'employ雇佣 + ment名词后缀 → employment雇佣', 'em-pl[oy]-ment'),
('remain', '/rɪˈmeɪn/', 'v.剩余；逗留；  link-v.保持；  n.剩余物（复数）；遗迹；残骸', 'to continue to be something; to be still in the same state or condition and do not change', 'Only one puppy remained in the cage as the others were sold.', '笼子里只剩下一只小狗，其他的都售出了。', 're回 + main逗留 → 回来留下 → remain剩余', 're-m[ai]n'),
('length', '/leŋkθ/ /leŋθ/ ', 'n.长度；持续时间；一段 (绳子、布、木头等)；（书或文件的）篇幅，（影片的）时长', 'the size or measurement of something from one end to the other; the amount of time that something lasts; the distance from one end of a swimming pool to the other; the size of a horse or boat from one end to the other', 'The ruler is 15 cm in length.', '这把尺子长15厘米。', 'leng长 + th名词后缀 → length长度', 'le[ng]th'),
('unemployment', '/ˌʌnɪmˈploɪmənt/', 'n.失业', 'the state of not having a job', 'He lost his job in the wave of unemployment.', '在失业浪潮中，他丢掉了工作。', 'un不 + employ雇佣 + ment表示行为、行为的过程或结果 → unemployment失业', '[un]-em-pl[oy]-ment');
INSERT INTO `graduate_word` (`word`, `phonetic`, `translate`, `definition_en`, `example_en`, `example_cn`, `mnemonic`, `cloze`) VALUES
('tend', '/tend/', 'v.往往会发生某事；照顾，照料', 'to care for sb/sth', 'Men tend to put on weight when they become middle aged.', '男人到了中年体重往往会增加。', '', 't[en]d'),
('editor', '/ˈedɪtər/', 'n.（报刊、杂志的）编辑；主编', 'a person who prepares a book to be published', 'The chief editor checks and corrects a book’s text before publication.', '总编辑在出版之前检查和校订书中文本。', 'edit编辑 + or表示人 → editor编者，编辑', 'e-di-t[or]'),
('colonel', '/ˈkɜːrnl/', 'n.上校', 'an officer of high rank in the army', 'Colonel refers to an officer of high rank in the army or marines.', '上校是陆军或海军陆战队的高级军官。', 'colon纵队 + el名词后缀 → 站在队伍前面的人 → colonel上校', 'colon[el]'),
('delay', '/dɪˈleɪ/', 'v.延误，延迟；磨蹭，使迟到', 'to make somebody late or force them to do something more slowly ', 'His flight is delayed because of bad weather.', '他的航班由于恶劣的天气晚点了。', 'de从...离开 + lay留下，停留 → delay延迟', 'de-l[ay]'),
('instrumental', '/ˌɪnstrəˈmentl/', 'adj.乐器的；仪器的；有帮助的', 'made by or for musical instruments', 'They only play instrumental music; their band doesn''t have a singer.', '这个乐队只有乐器演奏，他们没有歌手。', 'in进入 + strument=struct建立 + al……的 → instrument开始建立=起作用 + al……的  → 起作用的', 'in-stru-m[en]-t[al]'),
('despatch', '/dɪˈspætʃ/', 'v.发送；  n.（公文）急件', 'to send a letter', 'The express company despatches mails with high efficiency and low price.', '这家快递公司送快递效率高，而且价格便宜。', 'des=dis表否定 + patch固定，系紧 → despatch发送；派遣', ''),
('competition', '/ˌkɑːmpəˈtɪʃn/ ', 'n.比赛，竞赛；竞争', 'a situation in which people or organizations compete with each other for something that not everyone can have', 'Who is going to win this competition?', '谁将赢得这场比赛呢？', 'compet=compete竞争 + ition名词后缀 → competition比赛', 'com-pe-t[i]-t[ion]'),
('plea', '/pliː/', 'n.恳求，请求；（法律）抗辩', 'an urgent emotional request', '"My son made a plea—he wanted to stop practicing his music', '我儿子提出了一个请求——他不想再练音乐了，但是我没有同意。', '', '[ple]a'),
('riot', '/ˈraɪət/', 'v.闹事；  n.骚乱；暴乱；骚动；放纵', '(of a crowd of people) to behave in a violent way in a public place', 'Some people are rioting to express dissatisfaction.', '一些人为了表达不满正在闹事。', '', 'r[i]-ot'),
('comprehensive', '/ˌkɑːmprɪˈhensɪv/', 'adj.全面的，完整的；详尽的', 'includes everything that is needed or relevant; including all', 'She''s making a comprehensive consideration of all her options.', '她正在全面考虑她所有的选择。', 'comprehens理解 + ive形容词后缀 → comprehensive有理解力的；综合的', 'com-pr[e]-h[en]-sive'),
('institution', '/ˌɪnstɪˈtuːʃn/', 'n.机构', 'an organization founded and united for a specific purpose', 'This English language training institution is very popular with parents and their children alike.', '这家英语培训机构很受家长和孩子们的欢迎。', 'in在......里 + stitut建立 + ion名词后缀 → institution机构', '[in]-sti-tu-t[io]n'),
('chin', '/tʃɪn/', 'n.颏，下巴', 'the part of the face below the mouth and above the neck', 'The doctor is drawing a line at her chin.', '医生正在她的下巴处画一条线。', '', 'Ch[in]'),
('colleague', '/ˈkɑːliːɡ/', 'n.同事', 'a person that you work with', 'I really learned a lot by discussing with my colleagues.', '通过和同事们讨论，我真的学到了很多。', 'col共同 + league捆绑 → 捆绑在一起的人 → colleague同事', 'c[oll]eague'),
('inflation', '/ɪnˈfleɪʃn/', 'n.通货膨胀', 'a general rise in the prices of services and goods in a particular country', '"Because of the inflation', '因为通货膨胀，我们用同样的钱只能买到更少的水果。', 'in进 + flat吹 + ion表名词 → 充气；通货膨胀', 'in-fla-t[io]n'),
('confer', '/kənˈfɜːr/', 'v.授予（奖项、学位、荣誉或权利）；商讨，协商', 'to give somebody an award', 'The president conferred a degree to the graduating student.', '校长授予这个毕业生学位。', 'con共同 + fer带来，拿来 → 共同带来观点 → confer协商，谈判', ''),
('expose', '/ɪkˈspəʊz/', 'v.显露，暴露；揭露', 'to show something that is usually hidden; to tell the true facts about a person or a situation', '"Some cement fell from the wall', '墙上的水泥掉下来后，砖块露了出来。', 'ex出，出去 + pose放 → 放出去 → expose暴露', 'ex-pos[e]'),
('leather', '/ˈleðər/', 'n.皮革；皮制品', 'material made by removing the hair or fur from animal skins and preserving the skins using special processes', 'The sofa and pillow are covered in real leather.', '沙发和枕头都是真皮做的。', '', 'lea[th]er'),
('pregnant', '/ˈpreɡnənt/', 'adj.怀孕的，妊娠的', '(of a woman or female animal) having a baby or young animal developing inside her/its body', 'The pregnant woman is drinking water.', '这个怀孕的女人正在喝水。', 'pre前的 + gnant=gnasci出生 → pregnant怀孕的，妊娠的', 'preg-n[an]t'),
('compliment', '/ˈkɑːmplɪmənt/', 'n.赞扬；称赞', 'a remark that expresses praise or admiration of somebody; polite words or good wishes', 'The couple were satisfied with their dinner and paid the chef a compliment.', '这对夫妇对晚餐很满意，还称赞了厨师。', '', 'com-pli-m[en]t'),
('prey', '/preɪ/ ', 'n.猎物；  v.捕食', 'an animal', 'Oh no! The man is the prey of the tiger!', '糟糕！那个男人成了老虎的食物!', '', 'pr[ey]'),
('peculiar', '/pɪˈkjuːliər/', 'adj.奇怪的，古怪的；特有的，特别的', 'strange or unusual', 'These mooncakes'' flavors are very peculiar.', '这些月饼的口味很奇怪。', 'peculi特有 + ar……的 → peculiar特有的', 'pe-cu-li[ar]'),
('consolidate', '/kənˈsɑːlɪdeɪt/', 'v.巩固，加强；把……合为一体', 'to join things together into one; to be joined into one', 'Workers put the bricks together to consolidate the wall.', '工人们把砖头砌在一起来加固墙体。', 'con共同 + solid坚固 + ate动词后缀 → 成为大家的财产 → consolidate巩固，加强', 'c[on]-so-l[i]-date'),
('marginal', '/ˈmɑːrdʒɪnl/', 'adj.微小的，不重要的；边缘的', 'small and not important', 'Her score showed only a marginal improvement. ', '她的分数只有略微的提高。', 'margin边缘 + al表示属于……的、具有……性质的、如……的 → marginal微小的，不重要的', 'mar-gin-[al]'),
('suite', '/swiːt/', 'n.（旅馆的）套间', 'a set of rooms', 'This hotel suite is big enough for a whole family to live in.', '这间酒店套房足够一家人住。', '', 's[ui]te'),
('intelligent', '/ɪnˈtelɪdʒənt/', 'adj. 有智慧的，聪明的', 'good at learning', '"If you are as intelligent as this scientist', '如果你像这位科学家那么聪明，你就有可能改变世界。', 'intellig知识界 + ent表示具有……性质的 → intelligent智能型的，聪明的', '[in]-telli-gent'),
('boil', '/bɔɪl/', 'v.烧开，煮沸，沸腾', 'when a liquid boils or when you boil it', 'As the water boils it gives off steam.', '水沸腾了，冒着水蒸气。', '', 'b[oi]l'),
('mosaic', '/moʊˈzeɪɪk/', 'n.镶嵌细工，马赛克', 'a picture or pattern made by placing together small pieces of glass', '"The ceramic mosaic consists of many small colorful tiles', '陶瓷马赛克由许多彩色的小瓷砖组成，它们一起组成一个图像。', '', 'Mo-s[a]-ic'),
('revive', '/rɪˈvaɪv/', 'v.（使）苏醒；（使）复苏，（使）复兴', 'to become', 'She is using this device to revive the unconscious man.', '她正在用这个设备让这位昏迷的男性苏醒。', 're再，重新 + vive生命 → revive恢复；（使）复苏', 'r[e]-vive'),
('vaccine', '/vækˈsiːn/', 'n.疫苗', 'a substance that is put into the blood and that protects the body from a disease', 'The little girl takes a vaccine every fall to protect herself from the flu.', '这个小女孩每年秋天都会接种疫苗来预防流感。', '', 'vacc[in]e'),
('flap', '/flæp/', 'v.拍打，挥动，振翅；拍动（翅膀）；  n.拍打，挥动', 'if a bird flaps its wings', 'The bird is flapping its wings.', '鸟拍打着翅膀。', '', 'fl[a]p'),
('loaf', '/loʊf/', 'n.一条（面包）；  v.虚度光阴', 'an amount of bread that has been shaped and baked in one piece', 'The loaf of bread has been cut into slices.', '这条面包被切成了很多片。', '', 'l[oa]f'),
('foam', '/foʊm/', 'n.泡沫；泡沫橡胶', 'a chemical substance that forms or produces a soft mass of very small bubbles', 'I made a heart with the foam.', '我用泡沫做了个爱心的图案。', '', 'f[oa]m'),
('conviction', '/ kənˈvɪkʃən /', 'n.定罪', 'the act of finding somebody guilty of a crime in court; the fact of having been found guilty', '"After his conviction', '在他被定罪以后，他就被关进了监狱。', 'convict使定罪 + ion名词后缀 → conviction 定罪', 'con-vic-t[ion]'),
('roar', '/rɔːr/', 'n.吼叫声，轰鸣声；  v.咆哮；  v.大声呼喊', 'a loud deep sound made by an animal', 'The tiger let out a mighty roar on the cliff.', '这只老虎在山崖上发出威猛的怒吼。', '', 'r[oar]'),
('stumble', '/ˈstʌmbl/', 'v.绊跌，绊倒；结结巴巴地说话', 'to hit your foot against something while you are walking or running and almost fall; to walk or move in an unsteady way', 'I stumbled over the red block and almost fell.', '我被红色的砖块绊倒了，差点摔下去。', '', 'stum-[ble]'),
('minor', '/ˈmaɪnər/ ', 'adj.较小的', 'not very large', 'A parking ticket is a minor violation.', '乱停车被罚属于较轻的违章。', 'min小 ＋ or表物 → minor较小的；较少的', 'mi-n[or]'),
('analyse', '/ˈænəlaɪz/', 'v.分析，分解', 'consider it carefully or use statistical methods in order to fully understand it', '"Knowing how to analyse the stock market', '因为他知道如何分析股票市场，所以他挣了不少钱。', '', 'an[al]yse'),
('vague', '/veɪg/', 'adj.含糊的，模糊的', 'not clear in a person’s mind; not having or giving enough information or details about something; (of a person’s behaviour) suggesting a lack of clear thought or attention; not having a clear shape', 'He didn''t understand her vague words.', '他没有理解女孩含糊的话语。', '', 'va[gue]'),
('solar', '/ˈsoʊlər/', 'adj.太阳能的；太阳系的；日光的；太阳的；  n.日光浴室', 'of or connected with the sun; produced by or using the sun''s light or heat', 'The solar energy is collected to generate electricity.', '人们把太阳能收集起来用于发电。', 'sol太阳 + ar与...有关 → 太阳的', 'so-l[ar]'),
('powder', '/ˈpaʊdər/', 'n.粉末；细面；火药；  v.抹粉', 'a dry mass of very small fine pieces or grains', 'The white powder is flour which can be used to make bread.', '这种白色的粉末是面粉，可以用来做面包。', '', 'pow-d[er]'),
('garlic', '/ˈɡɑːrlɪk/', 'n.大蒜', 'a vegetable of the onion family with a very strong taste and smell', 'Garlic is commonly found in kitchens.', '厨房里常常能看见大蒜。', 'gar矛 + lic=leek韭葱 → 像矛头的韭葱 → 大蒜', 'g[ar]-lic'),
('heroic', '/hɪˈroʊɪk/', 'adj.英勇的；英雄的', 'showing extreme courage and admired by many people; of or relating to heroes', 'An ordinary man may also make a heroic move.', '一个普通人也能做出英勇的举动。', 'hero英雄 + ic形容词后缀 → heroic英雄的', 'h[er]o-ic'),
('stocking', '/ˈstɑːkɪŋ/', 'n.长（筒）袜', 'either of a pair of thin pieces of clothing that fit closely over a woman’s legs and feet', 'Stockings can be a great way to keep warm.', '长筒袜可以起到很好的保暖作用。', 'stock树干，筒状物 + ing名词后缀 → stock腿 + ing名词后缀 → stocking长筒袜', 'stock-[ing]'),
('courtesy', '/ˈkɝːtəsi/', 'n.礼貌', 'a polite thing that you say or do when you meet people in formal situations', 'He helped her out of the car out of courtesy.', '他出于礼貌扶她下了车。', '', 'c[our]-tesy'),
('gallon', '/ˈɡælən/', 'n.加仑', 'a unit for measuring liquid. In the UK', 'This big bottle can contain a gallon of water.', '这个大瓶子可以装一加仑水。', '', 'g[all]on'),
('saucer', '/ˈsɔːsər/', 'n.茶碟，茶托', 'a small shallow round dish that a cup stands on', 'Please place your cup on a saucer to keep the table clean.', '请把你的杯子放在茶托里，以保持桌面清洁。', 'sauce调味汁 + r=er表名词，…的人或物 → 装调料的碟子 → saucer茶托', 'sauc[er]'),
('tow', '/toʊ/', 'v.拖，牵引', 'to pull (a vehicle) behind another vehicle with a rope or chain', 'The truck is towing away an accident vehicle.', '卡车正在拖走一辆事故车辆。', '', 't[ow]'),
('model', '/ˈmɑːdl/', 'v.模仿', 'to design or imitate forms : make a pattern', 'The little boy models how to shave after his father.', '这个小男孩模仿他父亲刮胡子的方式。', '', 'mod-[el]'),
('press', '/pres/', 'n.新闻界；印刷机', 'the press the Press the journalists and photographers who work for newspapers and magazines', 'The press is ready for the speaker to show up.', '媒体已经准备好了，就等着发言人现身。', '', 'pre[ss]'),
('technology', '/tekˈnɑːlədʒi/', 'n.科技；技术，工艺，工程技术', 'the use of science in industry', 'Now there are more and more technology products in our lives.', '现在我们的生活中科技产品越来越多。', 'techno技术，能力 + logy学说 → 技术，科技', 'te[ch]-no-l[o]-gy'),
('economy', '/ɪˈkɑːnəmi/ ', 'n.经济', 'the relationship between production', 'The economy is improving and people have more money.', '经济正在改善，人们也有了更多的钱。', 'eco环境，经济 + nomy学术领域 → economy经济（学）', 'e-c[o]-n[o]-my'),
('raise', '/reɪz/', 'v.举起，抬高；提升；筹集，筹（钱）；增加；提高', 'to lift or move (something or someone) to a higher position', 'The kitten raises his friend up to steal the fish.', '这只小猫咪把朋友举起来偷鱼。', '', 'r[ai]se'),
('budget', '/ˈbʌdʒɪt/', 'n.预算', 'the money that is available to a person or an organization and a plan of how it will be spent over a period of time', 'The total amount on the shopping list is over my budget.', '购物清单的总额超出了我的预算。', '', 'bud-g[e]t'),
('pain', '/peɪn/', 'n.痛，痛苦；努力，劳苦', 'the feelings that you have in your body when you have been hurt or when you are ill/sick', 'He is suffering great pain in his neck and back.', '他感觉脖颈和后背特别疼。', '', 'p[ai]n'),
('swallow', '/ˈswɑ:ləʊ/ ', 'v.相信；吞下；咽下', 'to make food', 'The jury swallowed the evidence and agreed he was  guilty.', '陪审团相信了这个证据，同意他有罪。', '', 'sw[all]ow'),
('comic', '/ˈkɑːmɪk/', 'adj.滑稽的，使人发笑的；  n.连环漫画', 'amusing and making you laugh; connected with comedy (= entertainment that is funny and that makes people laugh)', 'His comic actions often make us laugh.', '他滑稽的动作经常使我们大笑。', 'com作乐 + ic形容词后缀 → comic好笑的，滑稽的', 'com-[i]c'),
('clip', '/klɪp/', 'n.（电影、电视节目的）片段', '(often in compounds) a small metal or plastic object used for holding things together or in place', 'He enjoys watching clips from classic movies.', '他喜欢看经典电影的片段。', '', 'cl[i]p'),
('outbreak', '/ˈaʊtbreɪk/', 'n.（战争、疾病等坏事的）爆发，突然发生', 'the sudden start of something unpleasant', 'The soldiers were adequately prepared for the outbreak of war.', '战士们在战争爆发前做了充分的准备。', 'out向外 + break破裂 → 向外破裂 → outbreak爆发', '[ou]t-break'),
('foundation', '/faʊnˈdeɪʃn/', 'n.地基；基金会', 'a layer of bricks', 'A strong building needs a solid foundation.', '一座坚固的建筑需要有稳固的地基。', 'found基础 + ation表名词 → foundation基础，地基', 'f[ou]n-da-tion'),
('deceit', '/dɪˈsiːt/', 'n.欺骗，欺诈', 'dishonest behavior that is meant to fool or trick someone', 'He skillfully masks deceit behind a veil of joy.', '他将欺骗巧妙隐藏于愉悦外表下。', 'de从，表贬义 + ceit拿走 → deceit欺骗', 'de-c[ei]t'),
('defect', '/ˈdiːfekt/', 'n.缺陷，缺点，不足之处', 'a fault in something or in the way it has been made which means that it is not perfect', '"There is a defect with the jade bracelet', '这个玉镯有个小缺陷，大大降低了它的价值。', 'de不 + fect做，制作 → 没做好 → defect缺点，缺陷', 'de-f[e]ct'),
('extent', '/ɪkˈstent/', 'n.程度；长度', 'how large', 'The extent of the damage from the earthquake is massive.', '这场地震的破坏程度太大了。', 'ex出 + tent伸展 → 伸出去的范围 → extent范围', 'ex-t[e]nt'),
('aspect', '/ˈæspekt/', 'n.（问题等的）方面', 'a particular part or feature of a situation', 'The students are recording every aspect of the plant''s growth.', '学生们正在记录这株植物生长的各个方面。', 'a来，临近 + spect看 → 看的东西 → aspect外表，容貌，形势，方面', 'as-p[e]ct'),
('advisable', '/ədˈvaɪzəbl/', 'adj.明智的', 'wise', 'Eating more vegetables if you want to keep fit is an advisable option.', '如果你想保持健康，多吃蔬菜是一个明智的选择。', 'advis=advise建议的 + able …的 → 可以参照的 → 可取的；明智的', 'ad-vis-a[ble]'),
('suspicious', '/səˈspɪʃəs/', 'adj.可疑的', 'feeling that somebody has done something wrong', 'The policeman found the man''s behavior suspicious.', '警察发现这个人的行为很可疑。', 'suspici怀疑 + ous形容词后缀 → suspicious猜疑的', 'sus-pi-ci[ou]s'),
('effect', '/ɪˈfekt/', 'n.效果；结果；影响；印象；  v.使发生；产生', 'a particular look', 'That lighting effect makes the stage look very mysterious.', '那种灯光效果使舞台看起来很神秘。', 'ef出 + fect做，制作 → 做出来 → effect实施，生效；效果', 'e[ff]ect'),
('stare', '/ster/', 'v.盯，凝视', 'to look at somebody/something for a long time', 'She secretly stared at others from behind the window.', '她在窗户后面偷偷地盯着别人。', '', 'st[are]'),
('victim', '/ˈvɪktɪm/', 'n.受害者', 'a person who has been attacked', '"The family are victims of the flood', '这一家人是这次洪灾的受害者，现在他们无家可归了。', '', 'vic-t[i]m'),
('tire', '/ˈtaɪər/', 'v.使疲倦；  n.（=tyre）轮胎，车胎', 'to become tired and feel as if you want to sleep or rest; to make somebody feel this way', 'He was beginning to tire after a long day of work.', '一整天的工作后，他开始感到疲倦了。', '', 't[ire]'),
('wave', '/weɪv/', 'n.海浪，波浪；挥手；  v.挥手，招手', 'an area of moving water that is raised above the main surface of an ocean', 'The stormy waves are washing off the drawing on the beach.', '凶猛的海浪就快把海滩上的画冲掉了。', '', 'W[a]ve'),
('emperor', '/ˈempərər/', 'n.皇帝', 'the ruler of an empire', '"In ancient China', '在中国古代，皇上有着至高无上的权力。', 'emper命令，统治 ＋ or表示人 → 统治者 → emperor皇帝', 'em-p[er]-or'),
('demographic', '/ˌdeməˈɡræfɪk/', 'adj.人口学的', 'of or relating to the study of changes that occur in large groups of people over a period of time :of or relating to demography', 'The demographic charts show the aging population in four of these countries.', '人口统计图表显示了其中四个国家的人口老龄化情况。', 'demo人民 + graph写，记录 + ic…的 → demographic人口统计的', 'de-m[o]-gr[a]ph-ic'),
('cave', '/keɪv/', 'n.山洞，洞穴；  v.塌落', 'a large hole in the side of a hill or under the ground', 'He went into the dark cave by himself.', '他独自一人走进了漆黑的山洞。', 'cav洞 + e → cave山洞', 'c[a]ve'),
('invalid', '/ɪnˈvælɪd/', 'adj.无效的；  n.病人，残疾人（读作/ˈɪnvəlɪd/）', 'not legally or officially acceptable', 'A damaged check is invalid.', '损坏的支票是无效的。', 'in不，非 + valid有效的 → invalid无效的', 'in-v[al]id'),
('pace', '/peɪs/', 'n.速度', 'the speed at which somebody/something walks', 'Drivers have to keep their pace up in order to deliver goods on time.', '司机们必须保持速度不减以按时送货。', '', 'p[a]ce'),
('statue', '/ˈstætʃuː/', 'n.雕像', 'a figure of a person or an animal in stone', 'The angel statue is carved out of stone.', '这座天使雕像由石头雕刻而成。', '', 'stat-[ue]'),
('notorious', '/noʊˈtɔːriəs/', 'adj.臭名昭著的，声名狼藉的', 'well known for being bad', 'The pirate was notorious for capturing every ship that sailed by.', '这个海盗因劫持每一艘经过的船而臭名昭著。', 'not知道，注意 + orious多…的 → 多得惹人注意的 → 恶名昭著的', 'no-to-r[i]-[ou]s'),
('enrol', '/ɪnˈroʊl/', 'v.参加，注册，登记，入学', 'to arrange for yourself or for somebody else to officially join a course', 'I''m thinking about enrolling for membership at the gym.', '我想注册成为健身房的会员。', 'en做，放入 + rol=roll卷，册 → enrol参加，登记', 'en-r[o]l'),
('rule', '/ruːl/', 'v.裁决', 'to give an official decision about something', 'The court ruled that the man was guilty.', '法院裁定那个人有罪。', '', 'ru[le]'),
('equip', '/ɪˈkwɪp/', 'v.装备；使有能力', 'to provide yourself/somebody/something with the things that are needed for a particular purpose or activity', 'The worker equips himself with several items.', '这名工人身上装备了好几样东西。', '', 'e-q[ui]p'),
('content', '"/ˈkɑːntent/', 'n.目录；内容；  adj.满足的', 'the different sections that are contained in a book', 'You can get a brief idea of a book from the table of contents.', '你可以从目录页了解一本书的大致内容。', 'con一起，全部 + tent拿  → 一起拿住  → content容量，引申为内容', 'con-t[e]nt'),
('suffer', '/ˈsʌfər/', 'v.感到（疼痛）', 'to be badly affected by a disease', 'He suffers from a bad toothache.', '他牙痛得厉害。', 'suf在下 + fer负重 → suffer承受', 'suff[er]'),
('unity', '/ˈjuːnəti/', 'n.团结，一致', 'the state of being in agreement and working together; the state of being joined together to form one unit', 'Our group''s strength lies in our unity.', '我们队伍的力量来源于我们的团结！', 'uni一个 + ty名词后缀 → 成为一个整体 → 联合；统一体；团结', 'u-n[i]-ty'),
('destructive', '/dɪˈstrʌktɪv/', 'adj.毁灭（性）的，破坏（性）的', 'causing destruction or damage', 'The destructive winds caused serious damage to the houses.', '这破坏力极强的风严重损坏了房屋。', 'de毁  +struct建立 + ive……的 → destruct毁灭 + ive……的 → 毁灭(性)的', 'de-str[u]c-tive'),
('enlarge', '/ɪnˈlɑːrdʒ/', 'v.放大，扩展', 'to make something bigger; to become bigger; to make a bigger copy of a photograph or document', 'I need to use a magnifying glass to enlarge the text.', '我需要用放大镜来把文字放大。', 'en使 + large大 → enlarge使扩大', 'en-lar[ge]'),
('chimney', '/ˈtʃɪmni/', 'n. 烟囱', 'a structure through which smoke or steam is carried up away from a fire', 'The smoke from the factory''s chimneys can be seen from miles away.', '老远就能看见从工厂烟囱里冒出的烟。', '', 'chim-n[ey]'),
('insult', '"/ɪnˈsʌlt/', 'v.侮辱；  n.侮辱的言辞或行为', 'to say or do something that offends somebody', 'The customer insulted the ice cream seller by throwing the money to the ground.', '这个顾客把钱丢在地上，以此来侮辱卖冰激凌的小贩。', 'in进入 + sult跳 → 踩到别人的脸上 → insult侮辱', '[in]-sult'),
('subscribe', '/səbˈskraɪb/', 'v.订阅；  v.申请', 'to pay an amount of money regularly in order to receive or use something', 'I subscribed to an online reading course and received regular information.', '我订阅了一门网上阅读课程，会定期收到信息推送。', 'sub在……下 + scribe写 → subscribe订阅', 's[u]b-scribe'),
('dinosaur', '/ˈdaɪnəsɔːr/ ', 'n.恐龙', 'an animal that lived millions of years ago but is now extinct (\\u003d it no longer exists)', '"100 million years ago', '1亿年前，恐龙统治着地球。', 'dino可怕的 + saur蜥蜴 → 可怕的蜥蜴状怪兽 → dinosaur恐龙', 'di-nosa[ur]'),
('hormone', '/ˈhɔːrmoʊn/', 'n.荷尔蒙，激素', 'a chemical substance produced in the body or in a plant that encourages growth or influences how the cells and tissues function; an artificial substance that has similar effects', 'A high level of male hormones makes him look masculine.', '大量的男性荷尔蒙使他看上去男人味十足。', '', 'h[or]-mone'),
('refresh', '/rɪˈfreʃ/', 'v.使恢复精神', 'to make the most recent information show', 'The long sleep had refreshed her.', '一场酣睡使她又精力充沛。', 're重新，再 + fresh新鲜 → refresh恢复精神，提神', 're-fre[sh]'),
('tram', '/træm/', 'n.有轨电车', 'a vehicle driven by electricity', 'The tram went through the city center.', '有轨电车经过市中心。', '', 'tr[a]m'),
('dew', '/duː/', 'n.露水', 'the very small drops of water that form on the ground', 'Dew forms on the grass every morning.', '每天清晨，露水在草上凝结。', '', 'd[ew]'),
('straw', '/strɔː/', 'n.吸管；稻草，麦秆', 'a thin tube of plastic or paper that you suck a drink through', 'Why do you need two straws for one drink?', '你一杯饮料为什么要两根吸管？', '', 'str[aw]'),
('eagle', '/ˈiːɡl/', 'n.鹰；（高尔夫球赛中）少击两杆入穴的成绩；  v.（高尔夫球赛中）比标准杆数少击两杆入穴', 'a large bird of prey (= a bird that kills other creatures for food) with a sharp curved beak and very good sight', 'A huge eagle is flying high in the sky.', '一只巨鹰在天上飞翔。', '', 'ea-[gle]'),
('suppress', '/səˈpres/', 'v.抑制（感情等）', 'to prevent yourself from having or expressing a feeling or an emotion', 'He is trying to suppress his anger.', '他在努力抑制自己的愤怒。', 'sup在…下面 + press压 → 压下去 → suppress镇压，压制', 'suppr[e]ss'),
('option', '/ˈɑːpʃn/', 'n.选择，选项；选修课；选择权；  v.得到或获准进行选择；调动球员', 'something that you can choose to have or do; the freedom to choose what you do', '"You have two options for lunch', '午饭你有两种选择：要么吃意面，要么吃比萨。', 'opt选择 + ion名词后缀 → 选择', 'op-t[io]n'),
('attack', '/əˈtæk/', 'v.攻击，进攻，袭击；  n.攻击，袭击', 'to use violence to try to hurt or kill somebody; to use weapons', 'The soldiers attacked the enemy during the war.', '在战争中，战士们对敌人发起了攻击。', '', 'atta[ck]'),
('comrade', '/ˈkɑːmræd/', 'n.战友', 'a friend or other person that you work with', 'He and his comrades fight together.', '他和他的战友们一起战斗。', '', 'com-r[a]de'),
('claw', '/klɔː/', 'n.爪；钳；  v.抓，挖；（艰难地）挪', 'one of the sharp curved nails on the end of an animal’s or a bird’s foot; a long', 'The cat has sharp claws.', '这只猫的爪子很锋利。', '', 'cl[aw]');
INSERT INTO `graduate_word` (`word`, `phonetic`, `translate`, `definition_en`, `example_en`, `example_cn`, `mnemonic`, `cloze`) VALUES
('sip', '/sɪp/', 'v.啜饮', 'to drink something', 'He can only sip his coffee as it''s still so hot.', '因为咖啡还很烫，他只能小口喝。', '', 's[i]p'),
('drawback', '/ˈdrɔːbæk/', 'n.缺点；障碍，不利条件', 'a disadvantage or problem that makes something a less attractive idea', 'His short arms are his main drawback; he''s struggling to reach the toilet paper.', '他的短胳膊是他最主要的缺点，他很努力地去够厕纸。', 'draw拉 + back后面 → 把人往后拉的东西 → drawback缺点，欠缺', 'draw-ba[ck]'),
('partial', '/ˈpɑːrʃl/', 'adj.不完全的；部分的', 'showing or feeling too much support for one person', 'This is only a partial list of items.', '这份列表只罗列了部分物品。', 'part部分 + ial形容词后缀 → partial部分的，偏心的', 'par-t[ial]'),
('deplore', '/dɪˈplɔːr/', 'v.谴责；对……深感遗憾；悲悼；痛惜', 'to strongly disapprove of something and criticize it', 'He was deplored by colleagues for his poor decision-making.', '他因决策失误而受到同事们的谴责。', 'de坏 ＋ plore喊，哭 → 不好的喊哭 → deplore悲叹，痛惜', 'de-pl[ore]'),
('endorse', '/ɪnˈdɔːrs/', 'v.代言', 'to say in an advertisement that you use and like a particular product so that other people will want to buy it', 'The celebrity is endorsing the brand''s lipstick.', '这位名人正在为这个品牌的口红代言。', '', 'en-d[or]se'),
('enrich', '/ɪnˈrɪtʃ/', 'v.使丰富', 'to improve the quality of something', 'Reading can enrich our minds.', '读书可以充实我们的头脑。', 'en使成某种状态 + rich富裕 → enrich使富裕', 'en-ri[ch]'),
('transcend', '/trænˈsend/', 'v.超越（经验、理性、信念等的范围），超过，超出', 'to be or go beyond the usual limits of something', 'Music''s beauty transcends national boundaries.', '音乐之美超越了国界。', 'trans横过 + cend攀爬  → transcend超越', 'tr[an]-scend'),
('agreeable', '/əˈɡriːəbl/', 'adj.（欣然）同意的', 'willing to do something or allow something', 'The customer was agreeable to my suggestions.', '顾客欣然接受了我的建议。', 'a去 + gree同意 + able形容词后缀 → 同意的 → agreeable愉快的；适意的', 'a-gree-a[ble]'),
('exceptional', '/ɪkˈsepʃənl/', 'adj.优越的，杰出的；例外的，特殊的', 'someone or something has a particular quality', 'He has an exceptional track record in the League of Legends World Championship.', '他在英雄联盟全球总决赛中有着卓越的战绩。', 'ex加强意义 ＋ cept拿 ＋ ion表行为 ＋ al...的 → exceptional例外的', 'ex-cep-t[ion]-[al]'),
('prosper', '/ˈprɑːspər/', 'v.（生意等）成功；繁荣', 'to develop in a successful way; to be successful', '"After struggling initially', '经过最初的奋斗，他的生意开始取得成功。', 'pro前面 + sper希望 → 希望在前面 → prosper繁荣', 'pros-p[er]'),
('obesity', '/oʊˈbiːsəti/', 'n.肥胖', 'the quality or fact of being very fat', 'The man suffers from obesity and lives an unhealthy lifestyle.', '那个患有肥胖症的男人过着一种不健康的生活。', 'obes肥胖的 + ity 指具备某种性质 → n.肥胖，肥大', 'obe-s[i]-ty'),
('whatsoever', '/ˌwʌtsoʊˈevər/', 'pron.任何', 'any or every; anything or everything; used when you are saying that it does not matter what somebody does or what happens', 'The man covers his ears when others say whatsoever.', '无论别人说什么，他都把耳朵堵上。', '', 'what-s[o]-ev-[er]'),
('passive', '/ˈpæsɪv/', 'adj.被动的；消极的；  n.被动语态', 'tending not to take an active or dominant part', 'Passive smoking causes great harm to children and pregnant women.', '被动吸烟会对儿童和孕妇造成很大的伤害。', 'pass忍受，受苦 + ive表形容词 → passive消极的；被动的', 'p[a]ssive'),
('honorable', '/ˈɑːnərəbl/', 'adj.荣誉的；品德高尚的；可敬的', 'showing high moral standards; allowing somebody to keep their good name and the respect of others', '"At this honorable moment', '在这个荣耀时刻，他获得了他的硕士学位。', 'honor荣誉 + able…的 → honorable光荣的，高尚的', 'hon-or-a[ble]'),
('exemplify', '/ɪɡˈzemplɪfaɪ/', 'v.举例说明；例示，是……的典范', 'to give an example in order to make something clearer', 'Charts exemplify the data effectively.', '图表有效地举例说明了这些数据。', 'ex出 + empl拿，获得 + ify成为 → exemplify举例说明', 'ex-[e]m-pl[i]-fy'),
